<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Shanjo</book>
  <para style="h">Magano</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mag</para>
  <para style="toc2">Magano</para>
  <para style="toc1">Magano ga Jesu Kilesite</para>
  <para style="mt1">Magano</para>
  <para style="mt2">ga Jesu Kilesite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">A majwi ge tanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Momu mwibuka magano na ga ganuna Jesu Kilesite ga ñoletwemo. Jesu ndi Nyambe na ga mu bonisa byonse byebyo i bintu buti a bonise a baika bakwe i bintu ibi bi botele uku tendaala wangu. Jesu kale ga tuma iñiloi lyakwe ku leta gaga a magano ku muika gwakwe Joani. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Joani kale ga paka i bintu byonse ibi sa bona. Mi bobu mbupaki bwakwe bweejwi li zwa kwa Nyambe no bupaki bwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ngwa mfwijaguzi u muntu uju a bala mu ku gongoza bobu u buboni bu li momu mwibuka mi imfwijaguzi kame nja bantu aba ba shugwa gaga a majwi ga bobu u buboni kakuli inako se ji li li afuwi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">A manzuminizo ga Joani ku bazumini <optbreak />bo tugugi twa 7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Ime nde Joani, mbazumini bo tugugi twa 7 twa mwilonga lya Asiya ndi ñolela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Nyambe uju a liko, noju ka liko noju na beko, mane no myoya ja 7 iji ji li afuwi no cikalo co bumfumu cakwe, ba mi we i cisemo no ku joja nenja. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />No Jesu Kilesite, umpaki a sepaala, u muntu gwe tanzi uku buka ku zwa ku bafu, u mujendesi go bamfumu belonga, a mi we i cisemo no ku joja nenja.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Ige bulyo a lumbigwe, uju na ga tu shaka mi na ga tu lamwina ku zwa ku bitendantu i bimangoju byetu ko malowa gakwe. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Na ga tu tenda a bantu bo mubuso no mapulisiti aba ba sebeleza Nyambe gwakwe Nesi. Impazimo no nguzu bi be kwa Jesu mu manako gonse ku twala koko! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />“Nga mu lole, ujo a keza bu zimbulukitwe ku majoba,”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniele 7:13</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">mi “a bantu bonse kuti na ba mu bone mane na ba se <optbreak />ba mu weja,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">mi a bantu bonse mwilonga “kuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">na ba lile kebaka lyakwe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakaliya 12:10</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="REV 1:7">Ee, kuti na ku be bulyao! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />U Mfumu Nyambe mbuti a co buti, “Ndime Alufa no Omega, gwetanzi no go mamaninino, uju a liko, noju ka liko, noju a si keza, go Nguzu-Jonse.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa bona Kilesite mu cibonwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ndime Joani, nde mukwenu uju a gwanene nenwe mu mapenzi no mu mubuso no mu ku zundamina kwetu kwa Jesu. Mu cikuli ca Patimosi ka ndi li kebaka lyeejwi lya Nyambe no bupaki bwa Jesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mwijuba lyo Mfumu Jesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gogu u mugambilo gu ta buti, “mwijuba lyo Mfumu Jesu” gwa sa talusa ijuba ili ka ba lapelanga a bazumini.</char></note>, aa ka ndi li mu Moya, kale nda shugwa mwishule lyangu ijwi inene sinagwe ni ntolombita, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />ili ka li ta buti, “Ibi so ko bone u bi ñole mwibuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibuka li ñoletwe momu mu ntimana, ka ga li mapupu a manene go ku vunga ka ba litusisanga ku kale.</char></note> mi u tumine lelyo ibuka ku bazumini bo tugugi twa 7 twa mu minzi ja Efese, Simina, Pegamo, Tiyatila, Sade, Filadelufiya no Laodiseya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Kale nda litemuna buti ndi bone u muntu uju ka gamba neme. Kale nda bona a malambi ga 7 ga bumbitwe a butale bwa gauda. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Mi mukati ko malambi kale nda bonamo u muntu ka kozete sinagwe ndi mwana muntu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniele 7:13</ref>.</char></note>, uju ka jabele u mukanjo ka gu ka sika ku matende gakwe. Ka li shumine u lukaku lo butale bwa gauda a cizuba. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Inshuki jakwe ka ji li jo ku tuba sinagwe mboja bongu na ji tubite sinagwe nkabundu, a mensho gakwe ka ga bega sinagwe mulilo gu jakila. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />A matende gakwe ka ga kozete i citale ca bulonze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulonze mbutale bu gwanene ne kopa ne senke. </char></note> ci la cenesegwa na ci la zwi a mulilo u munene gu zwa esita inene, mi ijwi lyakwe ka li shugwaala sinagwe ndijaba lyo menzi ga jenda. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Mwiganja lyakwe lyo mulyo, ka kwatilile intungwezi ja 7, mi mu kanwa kakwe kame ka ku zwa a kafulo ko bucesi bo bile. Inkumo jakwe, ka ji kozete ijuba libega mu ku munika kwalyo.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Aa ndi mu bona, kale nda gwila ku matende gakwe mane sinagwe ka ndi li go ku fwa. Kale ga ndi kwata ne ganja lyo mulyo mi kale ga ndi ta nage, “U leke uku joga. Ndime Gwe tanzi no go Mamaninino. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Ndime ndi Joja! Se ndi fwa, mi ngo lole, ndi la joja ku twala koko! Mi ndi li kwatilile i biatiso byo lufu ne cibaka co bafu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike no mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolwe buti “Hedisi”.</char></note>.<verse eid="REV 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />“Cwale, u ñole i bintu ibi u la boni, ibi bi liko aano ne bi na bi tendaale mwishule lyabyo. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />U buzinda bo ntungwezi ja 7 iji u la boni mwiganja lyangu lyo mulyo no malambi ga 7 aga ga bumbitwe a butale bwa gauda mbu bobu, intungwezi ja 7, mañiloi go tugugi twa 7 to bazumini ji zimanina. Mi a malambi ga 7 ntugugi twa 7 to bazumini.<figure style="fig" alt="Lampstands" file="lb00277b.jpg" size="col" loc="Rev 1:20" ref="1:20">A malambi ga 7 a nzimano jonke</figure><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mu munzi gwa Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Efese. U ñole buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:1" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:1">Aga ngo majwi gakwe uju a kwatilile intungwezi ja 7 mwiganja lyakwe lyo mulyo uju a jenda-jenda mukati ko malambi ga 7 aga ga bumbitwe a butale bwa gauda. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndi li zi i bitendantu byako, no bu u kozuwile ku misebezi jako mane no bu u zundaminine. Ndi li zi buti to goli uku zumininana no bantu a babi, mane na gwa jeleka na ba ba li kuga buti mbatumigwa kono ta li mbobo ku kalile mi kale gwa ba gwana buti mba manya. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Na gwa zundamina no ku li gongoza mu makababu kebaka lyezina lyangu, mi ta na gwa kotela.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Kono ndi li kwesi i bintu ndi ku tongauka kabyo. To si kwesi u lushako ulu ko kwesi etanzi. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />U gaje u bule bo ku na gwa ka angumuka no ku gwa! U siguluke mi u tende i bintu ibi ko tenda etanzi. Ati to siguluki, kuti na ndi keze kwako no keza ku zwisa lambi gwako mu cibaka cakwe. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Kono nanganceciba, aa u gwanina i cisemo mpa ku ta buti, u li zimbite i bitendantu byo Manikolai, ibi ndi zimbite neme.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Uju a kwesi a matwi, a shugwe ubu gu co u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini. Uju na gole, kuti na ndi mu we uku botelelwa uku lya ku biyango byo cishamu co bumi, ici ci li mu cibaka i cilotu ca Nyambe.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Simina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Simina buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:8" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:8">Aga ngo majwi ga zwa ku muntu uju a li Gwe tanzi no go Mamaninino, uju sa fwa mi sa la joja kame. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ndi li zi inkalilwa jako no bumpale bwako kono u li kwesi u lubono! Ndi li zi no busebe bo manya bobu ba ku kwagila aba ba li kuga buti Majuda kono ta li Majuda, kono mbantu bo kagugi ka Satani. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Uku leke ku joga kebaka lyo mapenzi aga ga botele uku ku kezela buti u pengisigwe. Satani kuti na keze ku tula bamwinya bo bagenzo mu ntolongo ku mi jeleka, mi kuti na mu penge a majuba ge kumi. U sepaale bulyo ku twala ku lufu mi kuti na ndi ku we u bumi sinagwe nciusi ci wegwa ku muntu uju a la goli.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi a shugwe i bintu ibi gu gamba u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini. Aba na ba gole no ka sika ku mamaninino, ta na ba kubazigwe ku lufu lwa bili.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Pegamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Pegamo buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:12" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:12">Aga ngo majwi ga zwa kwakwe uju a kwesi a kafulo a kanene ko bucesi bo bile. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndi li zi uku u kala buti nkoko a tulite Satani i cikalo cakwe co bumfumu. Kono igwe u li zundamine wawa mwizina lyangu. Ta na gwa shampula inzumino jako kwangu kebaka lyo mapenzi mane nanga mu nako iji na ga yagigwa umpaki gwangu uju a sepaala Antipasi uju sa yagigwa momo mu munzi gwenu, mu munzi u mu a kala Satani.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Kono nanganceciba, nko bi li i bintu i bice ibi ndi ku tongauka kabyo, nko ba si li bamwinya mukati kenu aba ba si gunzilile ku nzigo ja Bbalamu, uju sa ziga Bbalaki bo ku omenenena a bantu ba Isilaele uku tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju mi na ba lya i bilyo na bya tagilwa ku bibumbantu byo bazimu no ku tenda i cise. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Kame, u si kwesi bamwinya aba ba si gunzilile ku nzigo jo Manikolai. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Kebaka lelyo u siguluke! Aa to tendi bulyao kuti na ndi ku kezele wangu-wangu mi kuti na ndi keza ku ba lwisa ko kafulo a kanene ka mu kanwa kangu.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi a shugwe, ibi gu ta u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini. U muntu gense uju na gole, kuti na ndi ka mu we imana jimwinya iji ji bikamite. Kuti na ndi mu we nebwe lyo ku tuba aa ku ñoletwe izina iya, ili na zibe genke bulyo uju a li tambula.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Tiyatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Tiyatila buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:18" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:18">Aga ngo majwi ga zwa kwa Mwana Nyambe, go mensho ga kozete u mulilo gu jakila no go matende ga bega sinagwe ncitale cibega ca bulonze ici ci la cenesegwa. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndi li zi i bitendantu byako byonse, no lushako lwako no nzumino, insebelezo no zundamo jonse mane no ku ta buti so la tenda nenja ku ita ubu ko tendela etanzi.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Nanganceciba, ndi li kwesi ibi ndi ku tongauka kabyo. U li lekelele u mwanakazi uju a kugigwa Jezabele, u mwanakazi uju a li kuga buti muboni gwa Nyambe. Kono ndege a ziga no ku ungulula a baika bangu buti ba tende i cise no kulilila i bilyo bi tagilwa ku bibumbantu byo bazimu. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Se ndi mu wa a kaito ko ku sigulukila kwangu ku zwa ku cise cakwe, kono ta shaki. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Cwale, kuti na ndi mu shonje a bulo bo mapenzi, mi kuti na ndi pengise lwini bonse aba ba tenda i cise nage, mbwita aa ba siguluka ku cise cakwe. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Kuti na ndi kabe bane ku ba yaga mi u tugugi to bazumini tonse kuti na tuzibe buti ndiconse ndime ndi shakisisa i myojo no bigajantu byo bantu, mi kuti na ndi lomboze u muntu no muntu ku ja ko bitendantu byakwe.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Kono kwenu mwense mu munzi gwa Tiyatila, inwe ta mu gunzilile ku nzigo jakwe imangoju, no ku li ziga i bintu ba kuga bamwinya buti, mbuzinda u bunene bwa Satani (takuli u muzigo sa ka ndi mi kambike kame). <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Mbulyo ndi mi ta buti, mu gunzilile lwini kwe bi mu kwatilile ku twala aa na ndi ka bogwele.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Koju na gole no ku tenda ubu ndi shakila ku twala ku mamaninino kuti na ndi mu we inguzu jo ku jendesa a bantu bo malonga.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Ige ‘Kuti na ba jendese bu kwatilile u mulamu go citale co bumfumu,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="REV 2:27">mi kuti na ba sage ku ba tenda u tuempela sinagwe ntuempela to kazunga ko ku komauka,’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Nimbo 2:9</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 2:27">sinagwe ubu se ndi tambwila inguzu kwa Tata.<verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Kuti na ndi mu we kame nelungwe u lutungwezi lo masiku-siku. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi, a shugwe ibi gu gamba u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini!<figure style="fig" file="SHJ_245wbt - Seven Churches.indd" size="col" ref="2:29" /><verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mu munzi gwa Sade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Sade buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:1">Aga ngo majwi ga zwa kwakwe uju a kwatilile i myoya ja 7 ja Nyambe no ntungwezi ja 7. Ndi li zi i bitendantu byako. U la zibaala buti u la joja, kanti u li fwite. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Buka! U gongoze ici ci si sigalile kwako ici se ci shaka uku fwa kakuli na nda gwana buti i bitendantu byako ta bi lulikile mu mensho ga Nyambe gwangu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />U vuluke, i bintu ibi na gwa tambula ibi so zumina kwabyo etanzi. U bi gunzilile, u siguluke mi u zwe ku bitendantu byako i bimangoju. Aa no kangwe uku buka, kuti na ndi keze kwako sinagwe musa mi to no zibe inako iji na ndi ku kezele.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Kono momo mu munzi gwa Sade mo ba li a bantu a bace aba ta na ba vumba i bizwato byabo itukuta. Kuti na ba jende neme, bu zwesi mu bizwato byo ku tuba, kakuli ba li botelele uku tenda bulyao. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />U muntu gense uju na gole mane na ka sika ku mamaninino, kuti na zwate mu bizwato byo ku tuba sinagwe mbabo, mi ta na ndi zwise izina lyakwe mwibuka lyo bumi, kono kuti na ndi gambagule izina lyakwe kwa Tata no mañiloi gakwe. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />U muntu uju a kwesi a matwi gense a shugwe ibi gu ta u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Filadelufiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Filadelufiya, u ñole buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:7" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:7">Aga ngo majwi aga gamba uju a cenete go niti, uju a kwatilile i cigaluzo co mfumu Deviti. Ici a la galuli takuli uju a gola uku ci ga la, mi ici a la gali takuli u muntu uju a gola uku ci galula. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndi li zi i bitendantu byako. Ngolole, na nda ku tulila i cizi ci galukite afuwi negwe ici ta goli uku gala u muntu. Ndi li zi buti to gongwele wawa kono na gwa zundamina kwijwi lyangu mi ta na gwa shampula izina lyangu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Kuti na ndi lete buti a bantu bo kagugi ka Satani, aba ba li kuga buti Majuda kono mba manya ta li Majuda. Kuti na ndi lete buti ba gwile ansi ku matende gako no ku paka kwako buti ka ndi ku shaka. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Kakuli na gwa li gongoza no ku kutika ibi se ndi ku laga, neme kuti na ndi ku babalele mu nako jo mapenzi iji ji keza ku jeleka a bantu ba mwilonga lyonse.<verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Se nde keza aano. U gunzilile ku bintu ibi u kwesi buti u muntu na leke ku ku tapa u mupuzo gwako. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />U muntu gense uju na gole mane na ka sika ku mamaninino, kuti na ndi mu tule mu tempele ja Nyambe gwangu. Kuti na ndi mu tende sinagwe musumo mi ta si zwimo kame nela. Kuti na ndi ñole izina lya Nyambe gwangu akwe mane ne zina lyo munzi gwa Nyambe gwangu, Jelusalema u munzi u muya, ugu gu keza ku zwa kwigulu kwa Nyambe gwangu keza ansi. Mi kuti na ndi mu ñole kame ne zina lyangu iya. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi a shugwe ibi gu gamba u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iñolo ku kagugi ko bazumini <optbreak />ba mwa Laodiseya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“U ñolele iñiloi lyo kagugi ko bazumini ba mu munzi gwa Laodiseya buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:14" />
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:14">Aga ngo majwi ga zwa kwa Ameni, umpaki a sepaala no go niti, uju a li mujendesi go mbumbo ja Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndi li zi i bitendantu byako no ku ta buti, to tontoli kame toi. Ka ndi shaka buti ka li no tontola kampa noya! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Kono kakuli mbulyo u genya, toi kame to tontoli kuti na ndi ku suwe mu kanwa kangu! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />U li kwesi ukuta buti, ‘Ndi li gwa lubono, mi ndi la li gwanina takuli ici ndi bulite.’ Kono to nanguli buti u li mpai kame u li cikula u li mpale. U li muofu mi to zwesi. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Nda sa ku laga buti u gule kwangu a mabwe go butale u bulotu bwa gauda aga na ga cenisigwa ko mulilo buti u be no lubono. U gule kame no bijabalo byo ku tuba buti u jabale u bike inshoni jo cisense co mubili gwako, kakuli to zwesi, u gule no mushamu u lunge mu mensho gako, buti u bone.<verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Ime ndi la ku jukukilanga no ku laga a bantu bonse aba ndi shaka. Cwale u tongomane lwini, no ku siguluka. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ngolole! Se ndi li zimene a cizi na ndi kokota. Ati u muntu na shugwa ijwi lyangu no ku galula, kuti ndi ngine mu njugo jakwe no ku lya nage i bilyo nage a lye neme.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Ku muntu gense uju na li gongoze no ku gola, kuti na kale neme mu cikalo cangu co bumfumu sinagwe ndime aa na nda gola no ku kala no Tata mu cikalo cakwe co bumfumu. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi, a shugwe ubu gu co u Moya ku tugugi to bazumini.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">I cibonwa co cikalo co bumfumu ca Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Mwishule lya byebyo, kale nda lola mi kale nda bona i cizi ci galukite kwigulu. Kale nda shugwa ijwi ili na nda shugwa etanzi ka li gamba kwangu sinagwe ni ntolombita na lyo, “U kambamine kuno, mi kuti ndi ku sunde i bintu bi botele uku tendaala wangu ku zwa kwa byebi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Aobulyo kale nda ba mu Moya mi kale nda bona i cikalo co bumfumu mwigulu u mu ka ku kele u muntu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Mi jojo u muntu ka kelemo ka bonaala sinagwe ndibwe lya jasipa no lya lubi. I cikalo co bumfumu ka ci zimbulukitwe ku muciga-mvula ugu ka gu munika sinagwe ndibwe lya emelaluda. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ceco i cikalo co bumfumu ka ci zimbulukitwe ku bikalo byo bumfumu bimwinya bya 24 u mu ka ku kele a bakulu ba 24. Bonse ka ba zwesi i bizwato byo ku tuba mi ka ba tulite i biusi byo bumfumu byo butale bwa gauda ku mitwi jabo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ao a cikalo co bumfumu ka ku kwesi uku zwanga uku besagana ko mamuni go mvula, no nzumo jo milinga jo mvula. Uku ka ci zokele ceco i cikalo co bumfumu, nko ka ku li a malambi ga 7 aga ka ga jakila. Gago ne myoya ja 7 ja Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kame koko ka ci zokele ceco i cikalo co bumfumu, nko ka ci li i cintu ka ci kozete sinagwe ndi wate lyo cimponi, ici ka ci begela sinagwe ndibwe libelela lya kilisitale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ku zimbuluka ceco i cikalo, mpo ka ku li i bibumbigwa i byumi byone, mi ka bi kwesi a mensho a mubili gonse uku ka bi zokele no ku mashule. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />I cibumbigwa ce tanzi ka ci kozete undavu, cabili ka ci kozete ipulu, mi ca tatu ka ci kwesi inkumo ji kozete jo muntu, cane ka ci kozete unsika a gulukite. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Byonse byebyo i bibumbigwa byone bulyao cimwinya no cimwinya ka ci kwesi a mabando ga 6 mi ka ga kwesi a mensho egulu no mwinsi lyago. A kamwi no masiku ta ka bi leka uku zimba buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 4:8" />
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“ ‘Uju a cenete, Uju a cenete, Uju a cenete</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Nu Mfumu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:3">Isaya 6:3</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Uju kaliko, no jwa liko, noju a si keza.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Bebyo i bibumbigwa i byumi inako ka bi wa impazimo, ikute no ku litumela kwoju a kele mu cikalo co bumfumu noju a joja ku twala koko, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />a bakulu ba 24 ka ba gwila ansi afuwi nage uju a kele mu cikalo co bumfumu ku lapela ige uju a joja ku twala koko. Kale ba lalaika i biusi byabo byo bumfumu ansi afuwi no cikalo co bumfumu na ba ta nabo,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“U li botelele, igwe gwe Mfumwetu no Nyambe gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">uku tambula impazimo nekute no nguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Kakuli na gwa bumba i bintu byonse, mi ku ja ko bu ko shakila na bya bumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">mi mbyumi.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Ibuka li lamikitwe no Ngu-gana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Mi kale nda bona ibuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibuka li ñoletwe momu mu ntimana, ka ga li mapupu a manene go ku vunga ka ba litusisanga ku kale.</char></note> mwiganja lyo mulyo lyo muntu uju ka kele mu cikalo co bumfumu ili ka li ñoletwe egulu no mukati kalyo mi kame ka li lamikitwe ko bilamikiso bya 7. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Mi kale nda bona iñiloi lyo nguzu na li kugiliza keejwi inene ku gongoza na lyo, “Ndini a botele uku lamuna i bilamikiso no ku vwikula ibuka?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Kono ta na kwa gwanaala mwigulu no mwilonga mane no mwivu u muntu uju ka gola uku vwikula lelyo ibuka mane nanga nkuli lola mukati kalyo.<verse eid="REV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Kale nda lila lwini lwini kakuli ta na kwa gwanaala u muntu uju ka botele uku vwikula ibuka kampa uku lola mukati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Cwale jumwinya go bakulu kale ga ndi ta nage, “U mwene! Ngolole, Undavu go luasi lwa Juda, u Muisi gwa Deviti, na ga gola. Ndege a gola uku vwikula ibuka no ku lamuna i bilamikiso byalyo bya 7.”<figure style="fig" alt="Scroll with seals" file="gt00149.jpg" size="col" loc="Rev 5:1-5" ref="5:1-5">Ipupu ka li kwesi i bilamikiso bya 7</figure><verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Mi kale nda bona Ingu-gana, iji ka ji bonaala sinagwe se ji yagigwa, na ji zimene akati ko cikalo co bumfumu, na ji zimbulukitwe ku bibumbigwa i byumi byone no bakulu. Ingu-gana ka ji kwesi a manaka ga 7 no mensho ga 7, mi ne myoya ja 7 ja Nyambe iji na ja tuminwa mwilonga lyonse. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ingu-gana kale ja keza no ku inda ibuka mwiganja lyo mulyo lya jojo u muntu uju ka kele mu cikalo co bumfumu. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Mi aa sa la li indi, i bibumbigwa i byumi byone mane no bakulu ba 24 kale ba gwila ansi afuwi no Ngu-gana. Jumwinya no jumwinya ka kwesi ialepa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ialepa ncigombantu ci kwesi i miswa ici mu gola uku litusisa aa mu zimba i nimbo. </char></note> mi ka ba kwatilile u tusuba twa gauda tu vumbite insense, mi ngo matapelo go bantu ba Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Mi kale ba zimba u lwimbo u luya luta buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 5:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“U li botele uku inda ibuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">no ku lamuna i bilamikiso byalyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">kakuli so yagigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">mi ko malowa gako na gwa gulila Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">a bantu ku zwa mu maasi gonse no bantu bo migambilo jonse no bantu nelonga.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Na gwa ba tenda buti ba be u mubuso no mapulisiti aba ba sebeleza Nyambe gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">mi kuti na ba buse mwilonga.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Cwale kale nda lola mi kale nda shugwa ijwi lyo mañiloi a mangi wawa, ga sika a 10,000 go ma 10,000 mi kale ga zimbuluka i cikalo co bumfumu no bibumbigwa i byumi byone no bakulu. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Kale ga zimba ko majwi go ku gongoza nago,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 5:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Uju a botelele ni Ngu-gana, uju sa yagiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">buti a tambule inguzu no lubono no magano no kazula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nekute no mpazimo no malumbo!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Mi kale nda shugwa i bibumbigwa byonse mwigulu no mwilonga no mwivu no mwiwate, no bintu byonse ibi bi limo, na bi zimba nabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kwoju a kele mu cikalo co bumfumu no ku Ngu-gana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">ku be a malumbo nekute no mpazimo no nguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ku twala koko!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />I bibumbigwa i byumi byone kale byata nabyo, “Ameni,” mi a bakulu kale ba gwila ansi no ku lapela.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">I bilamikiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Kale nda lolelela Ingu-gana na lamuna i cilamikiso ce tanzi ku bilamikiso bya 7. Mi kale nda shugwa conke co bibumbigwa i byumi byone ci gamba mwijwi li kozete sinagwe mulinga, “Keza!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Kale nda lola, mi afuwi neme mpo ka ku zimene umbizi go ku muna go ku tuba! U muntu ka paamiteo ka kwatilile u buta, mi kale ga wegwa i ciusi co muntu a la goli, mi kale ga tigisa umbizi go ku muna sinagwe muntu a la goli bagenze mu nkondo.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ingu-gana aa lamuna i cilamikiso cabili, kale nda shugwa i cibumbantu i cumi cabili ci ta na co, “Keza!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Mi kale kwa zwa umbizi go ku muna jumwinya, go ku subila. U muntu ka paamiteo kale ga wegwa inguzu jo ku manisa uku joja nenja mwilonga no ku tenda a bantu buti ba li yage mwalyabo. Kale ga wegwa a kafulo a kanene.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ingu-gana aa sa la lamuni i cilamikiso ca tatu, kale nda shugwa i cibumbantu i cumi ca tatu ci ta na co, “Keza!” Kale nda lola mi a fuwi neme mpo ka li umbizi go ku muna go ku siya! U muntu ka paamiteo ka kwatilile i cipimiso mwiganja lyakwe. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Mi kale nda shugwa i cintu ka ci shugwaala sinagwe ndijwi mukati ko bibumbigwa i byumi byone, ili ka li ta na lyo, “A kakilu konke ko buloto kuti ka guligwe a masheleñi a botele uku belekela u muntu a musebezi gwejuba mutumbi, mi u tukilu to tatwe to maila nato tu belekelwe ejuba mutumbi bulyao, mi u leke ku jona-jona a mafuta no waine!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ingu-gana aa sa la lamuni i cilamikiso cane, kale nda shugwa ijwi lyo cibumbigwa i cumi cane li ta na lyo, “Keza!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Kale nda lola mi afuwi neme kale nda bona umbizi go ku muna go ku tutumuka! Izina lyo muntu ka paamiteo ndi Lufu, na umpililwe ku muntu ka zimanina i cibaka co bafu. Kale ba wegwa inguzu a lubazu lwane lo bantu ba mwilonga buti aba yage ko kafulo a kanene, injala no malwele, no bikolo-kolo bya mwilonga.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Aa sa la lamuni i cilamikiso co bu 5, kale nda bona mwinsi lyo lutala i myoya jo bantu aba na ba yagigwa kebaka lyeejwi lya Nyambe no ku gunzilila mu bupaki ubu ka ba kwesi. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Kaba kugiliza mwijwi inene nabo, “Ni nako ji sika kwibo gwe Nyambe go nguzu, igwe u cenete no go niti, iji ji sigalile ku twala aa no lomboze a bantu ba jakite mwilonga no ku ba wa u mulandu kebaka lyo ku tu yaga?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Mi jumwinya no jumwinya kale ga wegwa u mukanjo go ku tuba, no ku ba lugwila buti ba lindile a nako imfuwi bulyo, ku twala a mpalo ji kwanite jo baika bagenzabo mu nsebelezo, no bakwabo mu nzumino, aba na ba yagigwe sinagwe ubu na ba yagilwa.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Kale nda lolelela mane na lamuna i cilamikiso co bu 6. Kale kwa ba no ku ukuta u kunene kweevu. Ijuba kale lya siya sinagwe ndi sila lyo ku siya lyo ku suma a buanda bo boja bo kapuli, mi u kwezi konse kale kwa subila sinagwe malowa, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />no ntungwezi ja kwigulu kale ja gwila ansi ku ulumuka sinagwe mulya-nshwi gu sini ku binzwa gu ulumuka ku zwa ku cishamu ci ungisigwa kwikuli inene. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Igulu kale lya li vunga no ku li kokela sinagwe ndi pupu, no malundu gonse no bikuli kale bya kuzigwa ku zwisigwa mu bibaka byabyo u mu ka bi li.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Mi a bamfumu belonga, no bana bamfumu, no bajendesi bo nkondo, aba ba kwesi u lubono, a bantu bo nguzu, no bantu bonse, a baika na ba ta ba li a baika, kale ba tigila mu malambo ga mu mabwe no mu malundu ka bi kamamo. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Kale ba kugiliza ku malundu no mabwe nabo, “Mu tu gwile no ku tu bika<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Oseya 10:8</ref>. </char></note> buti u muntu uju a kele a cikalo co bumfumu a leke ku tu bona no ku tu bika ku bukali bo Ngu-gana! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kakuli ijuba inene lyo bukali bwabo li la siki, mi takuli uju a gola uku li ndumeela.”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">A bantu ba 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, kale nda bona a mañiloi gone na ga zimene mu mbazu jone jelonga, na ga kaka inkuli ji zwa mu mbazu jone jelonga ku ji kangwisa buti ji leke ku ungila ansi no a mawate kampa a cishamu conse. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Mi kale nda bona iñiloi li zwila ku buzwe-juba, na li kwatilile i cilamikiso ca Nyambe uju a joja. Kale lya kugiliza mwijwi inene ku mañiloi gone aga se ka ga wetwe inguzu jo ku jona ilonga newate, na lyo, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Mu leke uku jona ilonga kampa iwate kampa i bishamu ku twala aa na tu lamike i cilamikiso a makumo go baika ba Nyambe gwetu.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Kale nda shugwa ne mpalo jo bantu aba na ba lamikigwa. Ka ba li bantu ba 144,000 aba ka ba zwa mu maasi gonse ga Isilaele.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ku zwa mu luasi lwa Juda mbantu ba 12,000 na ba lamikigwa,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Lubbeni mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:5">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Gadi mbantu ba 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ku zwa mu luasi lwa Asele mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Nafetali mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:6">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Manase mbantu ba 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ku zwa mu luasi lwa Simioni mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Livi mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:7">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Isakale mbantu ba 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ku zwa mu luasi lwa Zebuloni mbantu ba 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Josefa mbantu ba 12,000</para>
  <para style="li" vid="REV 7:8">ku zwa mu luasi lwa Bbenjamine mbantu ba 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bantu a bangi ba zwesi mu mikanjo jo ku tuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo kale nda lola, mi kale nda bona a bantu a bangi aba takuli u muntu uju ka gola uku ba bala, aba ka ba zwa mu malonga gonse, mu maasi gonse no ku bantu bonse no ku migambilo jonse, na ba zimene afuwi no cikalo co bumfumu no Ngu-gana. Kaba jabele i mikanjo jo ku tuba na ba kwatilile intabi jo malali mu maganja gabo. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Mi ka ba kumba mu ku gongoza lwini nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 7:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Injojeso nkwa Nyambe gwetu ji li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">uju a kele a cikalo co bumfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">no ku Ngu-gana.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />A mañiloi gonse ka ga zimene ku zimbuluka i cikalo co bumfumu no bakulu no bibumbigwa i byumi byone. Kale ga gwila ansi no ka kaba a makumo gabo mwivu afuwi no cikalo co bumfumu no ku lapela Nyambe, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />nago,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 7:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Ameni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Uku lumbigwa no mpazimo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">no magano no malumbo nekute</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">no nguzu no kazula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">bi be kwa Nyambe gwetu ku twala koko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Mi jumwinya go bakulu kale ga ndi buza nage, “Mbani baba a bantu ba zwesi i mikanjo jo ku tuba no ku ba zwa nkwibo?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Kale nda taba buti, “Mfumwangu, igwe ndigwe gwizi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Mi kale ga ndi taba nage, “Baba mbo bantu aba na ba anda mu nkalilwa inene, mi na ba sanza i mikanjo jabo mu malowa go Ngu-gana no ku ji tenda jo ku tuba. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ko ku tenda bulyao,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 7:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Se ba li zimene afuwi no cikalo co bumfumu ca Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">no ku mu sebeleza a kamwi no masiku mu tempele jakwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">mi jojo a kele a cikalo co bumfumu kuti na ba babalele no <optbreak />ku kala nabo.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />‘Abo nela ta ba si fwi injala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">no nyotwa kame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Ijuba ta li si ba tenti,’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isaya 49:10</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">kampa u kuya ku cibangazi calyo.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Kakuli Ingu-gana uju a kele akati ko cikalo co bumfumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">kuti na be u mulisani gwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">‘Kuti na ba tangilile ku ba twala ku tuziba-ziba to menzi <optbreak />go bumi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isaya 49:10</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">‘Mi Nyambe kuti na singule i minsozi jonse ku <optbreak />mensho gabo.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isaya 25:8</ref>. </char></note> ”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">I cilamikiso co bu 7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Aa lamuna i cilamikiso co bu 7, kale kwa ba no ku ombelela mwigulu a nako ji botele icika lyo nako.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Mi kale nda bona a mañiloi ga 7 aga ga zimene afuwi no Nyambe, mi kale ga wegwa a mantolombita ga 7.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Iñiloi limwinya, ili ka li kwatilile a kalongo ka insense aka ka ka bumbitwe a butale bwa gauda, kale lya keza ku zimana afuwi no lutala. Kale lya wegwa insense iningi ku gwanika no matapelo go bantu ba Nyambe, go ku tagila a lutala lwa gauda ulu ka lu li a fuwi no cikalo co bumfumu. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />U busi ka bu zwa a insense na bu gwanene no matapelo go bantu ba Nyambe, kale bwa gulukila kwa Nyambe ku zwa mwiganja lyeñiloi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Mi iñiloi kale lya inda a kalongo ka insense, no ku ka vumba a makala go mulilo ugu na lya joka a lutala, no ku gu shonjela mwilonga, mi kale kwa keza i milinga jo mvula, no nzumo no ku besagana no mamuni no ku ukuta kweevu.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">A mantolombita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />A mañiloi ga 7 aga ka ga kwatilile a mantolombita ga 7 kale ga litukiseza uku ga fuza. <figure style="fig" alt="Trumpet being blown" file="lb00187b.jpg" size="col" loc="Rev. 8:6-13" ref="8:6-13">Intolombita ji fuzigwa</figure><verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Iñiloi lyetanzi kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi kale kwa keza imbwe no mulilo gu gwanene no malowa, mi kale bya shonjelwa ansi mwilonga. U lubazu lwa tatu lwelonga kale lwaya mi u lubazu lwa tatu lo bishamu kale lwaya, no bwiju bonse ubu ka bu sini uku juma kale bwaya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Iñiloi lyabili kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi i cintu ici ka ci kozete sinagwe ndilundu inene, ili ka li jakila, kale ca shonjelwa mwiwate. Mi u lubazu lwa tatu lo menzi gewate kale lwa zoka a malowa. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />U lubazu lwa tatu lo bibumbantu bi joja mu mawate kale lwa fwa, no lubazu lwa tatu ku mato a manene kale lwa jonauka.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Iñiloi lya tatu kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi u lutungwezi u lunene, ulu ka lu bega lwini sinagwe ndumuni, kale lwa gwa ku zwa kwigulu ku gwila a lubazu lwa tatu lo lwizi no tuziba-ziba to menzi, <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />izina lya lolo u lutungwezi ndi Kulula. U lubazu lwa tatu lo menzi kale lwa lula, mi a bantu a bangi kale ba fwa kebaka lyo kulula ko menzi.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Iñiloi lyane kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi u lubazu lwa tatu lwejuba kale lwa kabigwa, no lubazu lwa tatu lo kwezi, no lubazu lwa tatu lo ntungwezi, mi u lubazu lwa tatu lwabyo kale lwa siya. U lubazu lwa tatu lo kamwi kale lwa siya no lubazu lwa tatu lo masiku kale lwa ba bulyao.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Aa ka ndi si lolelele bulyao, kale nda shugwa unsika uju ka gulukite na jungite mwigulu-gulu na kugiliza keejwi ku gongoza nage, “U bumpai! U bumpai! U bumpai mbwa bantu aba ba jakite mwilonga, kebaka lyo mantolombita go tatwe aga ga si botele uku sibigwa ku mañiloi gamwinya go tatwe!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Iñiloi lyo bu 5 kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi kale nda bona u lutungwezi ulu na lwa gwa kwigulu ku gwila ansi. Kale lwa wegwa i cigaluzo co ku fwinkula elambo lyo kasula-muzumbi. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Aa sa la fwinkuli elambo lyo kasula-muzumbi, kale kwa tundumuka u busi sinagwe mbwa ku zwa mwileba lyo mulilo u munene. Ijuba negulu kale bya salukila kebaka lya bobo u busi ka bu zwa mwilambo lyo kasula-muzumbi.<verse eid="REV 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Mi momo mu busi kale kwa zwa izige ili na lya mwagalila mwilonga mi kale lya wegwa inguzu sinagwe nja mage ga mwilonga. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Kale lya lugwilwa buti li leke uku jona u bwiju bwa mwilonga kampa i cimenantu conse kampa i cishamu, kono mbwita a bantu aba ta ba kwesi i ciganto ca Nyambe a makumo gabo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Ta na lya zumininwa uku ba yaga, kono buti li ba pengise a myezi ja 5. Mi uku shisha ko mapenzi na ba penga nkwa ku koza sinagwe ninge ji shuma u muntu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Momo mu majuba, a bantu kuti na ba shake u lufu, kono ta na ba lu gwane kuti na ba shake buti na ba fwa kono u lufu, kuti na lu ba tige.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Lelyo izige kame ka li bonaala sinagwe mbambizi bo ku muna aba ba shiamine uku indigwa ku nkondo. A mitwi jalyo ka li tulite i bintu byo ku koza sinagwe mbiusi byo bumfumu byo ku bumba a butale bya gauda, mi a makumo galyo ka ga kozete a makumo go bantu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Inshuki jalyo ka ji kozete inshuki jo banakazi, mi a meno galyo ka ga kozete a meno go bandavu. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ka li kwesi i bijabalo byo bitakiso bya a bizuba bi kozete sinagwe mbitakiso byo citale bya a cizuba, mi a kalunga-lunga kejaba lyo mabando galyo ka ka shugwaala sinagwe ndi jaba lyo minsunta jo bambizi bo ku muna a bangi ba koka i bikocikala i bingi na ba tigilile ku nkondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ka li kwesi i micila no twiga tu liko to ku koza sinagwe ntwa mage mi koko ku micila nkoko ka li kwatile inguzu jo ku pengisa a bantu a myezi ja 5. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ka li kwesi mfumwalyo uju ka li jendesa mi ndi ñiloi lye lambo lyo kasula-muzumbi. Izina lya lelyo iñiloi ndi Abbadoni mu mushobo go Ciebelu no Apolioni mu mushobo go Cigelike (ku talusa u mujoni).<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />U bumpai bwetanzi kale bwa mana, kono ku si sigalile bumwinya u bumpai bo bile ubu bu si botele uku keza.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Iñiloi lyo bu 6 kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi kale nda shugwa ijwi li zwa ku manaka gone go lutala lwa gauda ulu ka lu li a fuwi no Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Ijwi kale lya ta iñiloi lyo bu 6 ili ka li kwesi intolombita na lyo, “Sungulula a mañiloi gone aga ga shumininwe ku lwizi u lunene lwa Yufilati.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Mi a mañiloi gone aga ka ga bikilwe jejo inako ne juba no kwezi no mwaka, kale ga sungululwa buti ga yage u lubazu lwa tatu lo bantu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Impalo ja gago a masole ka ba paamite a bambizi bo ku muna ndi 200,000,000. Kale nda shugwa wawa impalo jago.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />A bambizi bo ku muna no bantu aba ka ba paamiteo aba na nda bona mu cibonwa cangu, ka ba kwesi i bitakiso bya a bizuba byo ku subila sinagwe mulilo, no byo mubala gwegulu mane no ku biluluka sinagwe mulilo gwa silufula. I mitwi jo bambizi bo ku muna ka ji kozete i mitwi jo bandavu, mi mu tunwa twabo ka ku zwa u mulilo no busi no silufula. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />U lubazu lwa tatu lo bantu kale lwa yagigwa ku makababu gago go tatwe go mulilo, no busi no silufula ibi ka bi zwa mu tunwa twa babo a bambizi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Inguzu ja babo a bambizi bo ku muna mu tunwa twabo no ku micila jabo ka ji li, kakuli i micila jabo ka ji kozete sinagwe majoka. Ka ji kwesi i mitwi uku ka ji kubazisanga a bantu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Kono u bungi bo bantu aba ta na ba yagigwa ku makababu gaga ta na ba siguluka ku zwa ku bintu na ba tenda ko maganja gabo. Ta na ba leka uku lapela a mayauma, no bibumbantu byo ku bumba a butale bwa gauda, no cilivela, no bulonze, no mabwe no byo ku beja a bishamu, i mizimu iji ta ji goli uku bona kampa uku shugwa kampa uku jenda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Kame ta na ba siguluka ku zwa ku buyagi bwabo, no mabibo gabo, no ku cise cabo no ku busa bwabo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Iñiloi no kabuka a kanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ao kame kale nda bona iñiloi limwinya ili ka li kwesi inguzu inene li suka ku zwa kwigulu. Ka li jabele ijoba, no muciga-mvula egulu lyo mutwi gwalyo. Inkumo jalyo ka ji kozete ijuba, mi a matende galyo ka ga kozete i misumo ji jakila u mulilo. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Iñiloi ka li kwatilile a kabuka a kanunu, aka ka ka vwikulitwe mwiganja lyalyo. Kale lya lyatika itende lyalyo lyo mulyo ewate netende lyo monsho elonga. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Kale lya kumba ku gongoza keejwi ka li shugwaala sinagwe nu ndavu a gona. Aa se li la kumbi bulyao, kale kwa shugwaala a majwi go milinga ja 7 ji gamba ko ku zuma. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />I milinga ja 7 aa se ji la gambi, kale nda shaka uku ñola, kono kale nda shugwa ijwi kwigulu li ta na lyo, “Ibi bi la gambigwa ku milinga ja 7 u leke ku bi ñola, u bi zinde.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Mi iñiloi na nda bona li zimene bu lyatilile ewate no elonga kale lya nanwina iganja lyalyo lyo mulyo mwigulu. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Kale lya konka mwizina lya Nyambe uju a joja ku twala koko, uju sa bumba igulu no bintu byonse bi limo, noju na ga bumba ilonga no bintu byonse ibi bi limo, newate no bintu byonse ibi bi limo, mi kale lya ta na lyo, “Ta ku si li uku nangisa kame! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Kono mu majuba iñiloi lyo bu 7 aa na li shake uku fuza intolombita jalyo, Nyambe kuti na vumbilize i bintu a gajite mu buzinda, ku ja ko bu sa tela ku baika bakwe a baboni.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Mi ijwi ili na nda shugwa mwigulu kale lya gamba kwangu kame na lyo, “Jenda, u ka inde a kabuka a kanunu aka ka vwikulitwe mwiganja lyeñiloi ili li zimene bu lyatilile ewate no elonga.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Kale nda kaja kwa lelyo iñiloi no ka li kumbila buti li ndi we kako a kabuka. Ilyo kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “U ka inde mi u ka lye. Kuti ka ka ku shishise mwivumo, kono ‘mu kanwa kako kuti ka shugwaale u munati sinagwe mbuci.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:3">Ezekiele 3:3</ref>. </char></note> ” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Kale nda inda kako a kabuka a kanunu mwiganja lya lelyo iñiloi no ku ka lya. Kale ka shugwaala u munati mu kanwa kangu sinagwe mbuci, kono aa se ndi la kamini, kale nda tatika uku shisha mwivumo. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Mi kale nda lugwilwa buti, “U gambe a majwi go buboni bwa Nyambe kame ku bantu a bangi, bo malonga, no bo migambilo jo bantu jonse no bamfumu.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">A bampaki bo bile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Kale nda wegwa itaka lyo ku koza a kashamu ko ku jelekezisa mi kale nda lugwilwa buti, “U ka je u ka jelekeze i tempele ja Nyambe no lutala, mi u ka bale no bantu aba ba lapelamo. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Kono u leke ka jelekeza ilapa lya kunze jo tempele kakuli na lya wegwa ku bantu aba ta ba li a Majuda. Kuti na ba lyatagule u munzi gu cenete ko myezi ja 42. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mi kuti na ndi we inguzu ku bampaki bangu bo bile, mi kuti na ba gambe ko buboni a majuba ga 1 260, na ba jabele a masaka.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Babo a bampaki “mbishamu byo bile bya olive” no malambi go bile, mi “bi li zimene afuwi no Mfumu gwelonga.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zakaliya 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:14">14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ati u muntu jumwinya na jeleka uku ba tenda u bumangoju, se ku la zwa u mulilo mu tunwa twabo ku tenta ku jona a bantu aba ba ba zimbite. Bulyaa mbobo ka fwila u muntu gense uju ka jeleka uku ba kubaza. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Baba a bampaki ba li kwesi inguzu jo ku gala igulu buti umvula a leke ku shoka mu nako ba gamba byo buboni bwabo. Mi kame ba li kwesi inguzu jo ku zola a menzi ku ga tenda a malowa no ku kaba ilonga ko malwele ga andene-andene a nako aa ba shakila onse.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Babo a bampaki aa se ba la mani uku paka u bupaki bwabo, i cikolo-kolo ici na ci ane mwilambo lyo kasula-muzumbi kuti na ci ba lwise. Kuti na ci ba gole no ku ba yaga. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />I mibili jabo kuti na ji kwashame a nkanza jo munzi u munene ugu gu kugigwa ko magamba-nsabila buti munzi gwa Sodoma no Egepita. Momo na ba kankaminina no Mfumwabo a cifapaano. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />A bantu bonse, no maasi, no bantu bo migambilo jonse no bo malonga gonse kuti na ba lolelele i bitupu byabo a majuba go tatwe ne cika lyejuba mi kuti na ba kane buti ba zikigwe. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Mi a bantu bonse aba ba jakite mwilonga kuti na ba jangale ko mafu go baboni ba Nyambe bo bile mi kuti na ba li tumine a mampo mwalyabo bu jangele kakuli babo a baboni ba Nyambe bo bile na ba pengisa lwini a bantu ba joja mwilonga.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Kono aa se ku la iti a majuba go tatwe ne cika lyejuba u muuja go bumi gu zwa kwa Nyambe kale gwa ngina mwa byebyo i bitupu byo baboni ba Nyambe, mi kale ba zimana. A bantu aba na ba ba bona kale ba joga lwini. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Kale ba shugwa ijwi inene li zwa kwigulu li ba kuga na lyo, “Mu keze ko kuno.” Kale ba ja kwigulu mwijoba, a bantu aba ka ba ba zimbite na ba ba lolelele.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Momo mu nako kale kwa ba uku ukuta kwelonga u kunene mi u lubazu lwe kumi lo munzi u munene kale lwa gwa. A bantu ba sika a 7,000 kale ba yagigwa momo mu ku ukuta kweevu, mi a bantu aba na ba anduka kale ba joga lwini no ku wa impazimo kwa Nyambe gwegulu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />U bumpai bwa bili bu la mani, ku sigalila u bumpai bwa tatu ubu bu si botele u keza wangu.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Intolombita jo bu 7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Iñiloi lyo bu 7 kale lya fuza intolombita jalyo, mi kale kwa shugwaala a majwi a manene mwigulu ga gamba mu ku gongoza nago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“U mubuso gwelonga kale gwa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">u mubuso gwa Mfumwetu Nyambe no Mushaligwa gwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">mi kuti na buse ku twala koko.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Mi a bakulu ba 24, aba ka ba kele a bikalo byabo byo bumfumu afuwi no Nyambe, kale ba gwila ansi no ka kaba a makumo gabo mwivu mi kale ba lapela Nyambe, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />na ba ta nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 11:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Twa sa litumela kwako, Mfumwetu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">igwe u liko noju ka liko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">kakuli na gwa sebelisa inguzu jako inene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mi na gwa tatika uku busa.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />A bantu bo malonga kaba nyegele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kono u bukali bwako na bwa sika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Inako na ja sika jo ku atula a bantu na ba fwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">no jo ku wa i mipuzo ku baika bako a baboni ba Nyambe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">no bantu bako aba ba kutika izina lyako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">bonse a banene no banunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Inako na ja sika jo ku jonagula a bantu aba ba jonagula ilonga.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />I tempele ja Nyambe mwigulu kale ja galuka, mi mukati ko tempele jakwe kale kwa bonaala i ponkisi lyo nzumininano jakwe. Kale kwa keza uku besagana ko mamuni go mvula, no nzumo no milinga, no ku ukuta kweevu no mbwe inene.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">U mwanakazi nejoka inene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Mi kale kwa bonaala i cijuliko i cinene mwigulu ici ci komokwisa, co mwanakazi uju ka jabele ijuba, no kwezi kwinsi lyo matende gakwe no ciusi co bumfumu ka ci kwesi intungwezi je kumi no jo bile ku mutwi gwakwe. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Ka li musumba mi se ka li afuwi no ku bona mi ka kwesi uku takuma kebaka lyo kushisha.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Mi kame kale kwa bonaala i cijuliko cimwinya kwigulu cejoka inene wawa lyo ku subila, lyo mitwi ja 7 no manaka ge kumi no biusi byo bumfumu bya 7 a mutwi no mutwi gwalyo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />U mucila gwalyo kale gwa koka intungwezi kwigulu iji ji sika a lubazu lwa tatu lo mpalo jo ntungwezi jonse, no ku ji gwisikiza ansi. Lelyo ijoka kale lya zimana afuwi no jojo u mwanakazi uju ka shiamine uku bona u mucece buti li mine u mucece gwakwe a si bonigwa bulyo.<verse eid="REV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />U mwanakazi kale ga bona u mucece go muninzana uju “na jendese a malonga gonse ko mulamu go citale.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Nimbo 2:9</ref>.</char></note> Kono jojo u mucece gwakwe kale ga shompoligwa no ku twaligwa kwigulu kwa Nyambe no ku cikalo cakwe co bumfumu. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />U mwanakazi kale ga tigila mu mangusu mu bujoge, ku cibaka ici na ga mu lukiseza Nyambe, buti a ka mu babaleleleko a majuba ga sika a 1 260.<figure style="fig" alt="Woman and the seven headed dragon" file="gt00152.jpg" size="column" loc="Rev 12:1-4" ref="12:1-4">U mwanakazi nejoka lyo mitwi ja 7</figure><verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Mi kale kwa buka inkondo mwigulu. Mikaeli no mañiloi gakwe kale ba li lwisa no lelyo ijoka inene, mi ijoka inene no mañiloi galyo kale ba lwa nabo. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Kono lelyo ijoka inene kale lya kangwa uku li lamwina kakuli ta ka li gongwele mi kale bya tandigwa mu bibaka byabyo bya mwigulu. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Lelyo ijoka inene, lya ku nkulu-katanzi ili ka li kugigwa u mubi kampa Satani, uju a omanga no ku ungulula a bantu ba mwilonga lyonse, kale lya shonjelwa ansi antu-onke no mañiloi galyo.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Mi kale nda shugwa ijwi mwigulu li gongoza na li ta na lyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Cwale injojeso ji la siki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">no nguzu no mubuso gwa Nyambe gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">no nguzu jo Mushaligwa gwakwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Kakuli u mushangezi go bakwetu bo bankosi no banakazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">uju aba shangezanga i bintu a kamwi no masiku kwa Nyambe na ga shonjelwa ansi.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Na ba mu gola ko malowa go Ngu-gana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">nejwi lyo bupaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">bwabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Ta na ba shaka lwini u bumi bwabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">buti ba sundulukile mwishule ku joga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">u lufu.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Kebaka lelyo, mu jangale inwe mu jakite mwigulu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">Kono u bumpai mbwenu inwe mu jakite</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">mwilonga mane nenwe mu jakite mu mawate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kakuli Satani na ga sezumukila kwenu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">A li nyegele lwini kebaka lyo ku ta buti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">sa li zi buti inako jakwe ni nce.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ijoka inene aa li bona buti li la shonjelwa ansi, kale lya tanda-tanda u mwanakazi uju na ga bona u mwana go muninzana. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />U mwanakazi kale ga wegwa a mabando go bile go nsika u munene buti a gulukile ku cibaka ici sa lukisezwa ca mu mangusu, uku ka botele u ka babalelelwa a nako, no manako ne cika lyo nako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gogu u mugambilo go nako no manako no lubazu lo nako gwa sa talusa, i myaka jo tatwe no myezi ja 6. </char></note>, uku takali gola u ka sika ijoka inene.<verse eid="REV 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ijoka inene kale lya ndanyuna a mezi mu kanwa kalyo sinagwe ndwizi, buti ga ka lobeze jojo u mwanakazi no ka mu kukulula. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Kono ilonga kale lya tusa jojo u mwanakazi ko ku ñatuka sinagwe nkanwa ka ashama no ku mina gago a menzi aga na ga zwa mu kanwa kejoka inene. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Mi lelyo ijoka inene kale lya nyegelela jojo u mwanakazi mi kale lya bogola no ka lwisa bane bonse aba na ba sigala, bonse aba ba kutika i milao ja Nyambe aba ba gunzilile ku bupaki bwa Jesu.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Mi ijoka inene kale lya keza ku zimana ekamba lyewate.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">I cikolo-kolo ici na ca bomboka mwiwate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Mi kale nda bona i cikolo-kolo ci bomboka mwiwate co mitwi ja 7 no manaka ge kumi, no ciusi co bumfumu a lunaka no lunaka lwaco. A mitwi jaco jonse ka ku ñoletwe izina lyo kashwau. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />I cikolo-kolo na nda bona ka ci kozete ungwe, kono ka ci kwesi a matende go ku koza i bbele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Cigelike no mu mabuka gamwinya ndi bbele na ba tula mi ncikolo-kolo i cinene ci kwesi a matende a menene no nyala inde.</char></note> no mulomo go ku koza sinagwe ngwa ndavu. Ijoka inene kale lya wa ceco i cikolo-kolo inguzu jalyo no cikalo calyo co bumfumu no nguzu inene.<verse eid="REV 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />U mutwi go cikolo-kolo gumwinya, ka gu bonaala sinagwe ni nkubalo ka gu kwesi ji jogesa kono jejo inkubalo se ji ozwa. A bantu bonse ba mwilonga kale ba komokwa ceco i cikolo-kolo mi kale ba ciumpilila. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />A bantu kale ba lapela lelyo ijoka inene kakuli na lya wa inguzu ku cikolo-kolo, mi kale ba lapela ceco i cikolo-kolo na ba buza nabo, “Ndini uju a kozete i cikolo-kolo? Ndini a gola uku lwa naco?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Mi i cikolo-kolo kale ca zumininwa uku gamba a majwi go ku litunta no go kashwau, no ku ba no nguzu jo bujendesi a myezi ja 42. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Kale ca tatika uku shwauza Nyambe, no ku kwaga izina lyakwe no cibaka u mu a jakite mane no bantu bonse ba joja mwigulu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Kale ca wegwa inguzu jo ku lwisa a bantu bo kucena ba Nyambe no ku ba gola. Mi kale ca wegwa no nguzu a maasi gonse, no bantu bonse, no mishobo jo bantu bonse mane no malonga gonse. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Mi a bantu bonse aba ba jakite mwilonga kuti na ba lapele i cikolo-kolo. Babo mbantu aba ta na ba ñolegwa a mazina gabo mwibuka lyo bumi lyo Ngu-gana, iji na ja yagigwa ku zwa ku matatikilo go mbumbo jelonga.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />U muntu gense uju a kwesi a matwi, a shugwe.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />“Ati u muntu mu buika a tungulwize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kuti na ka be mu buika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Uju a botele uku yagigwa ko kafulo a kanene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kuti na ba muyagise ku kafulo a kanene.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jelemiya 15:2</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 13:10" />
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Mi byebyo bi li botele uku leta inzundamo, no ku sepaala ku lubazu lo bantu ba Nyambe aba ba cenete.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cikolo-kolo na ca zikuka mwivu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Mi kale nda bona i cikolo-kolo cabili, ci zikuka mwivu. Ka ci kwesi a manaka go bile sinangwe ni ngu-gana, kono ka ci gamba sinagwe ndijoka inene. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Kale ca litusisa inguzu jonse jo cikolo-kolo ce tanzi, mi kale ca leta buti a bantu bonse aba ba jakite mwilonga ba lapele i cikolo-kolo ce tanzi ici ka ci kwesi i cibatila ici ka ci gola uku leta u lufu ici na ca ozwa. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Kame kale ca tenda i bijuliko i binene, mane kale ca gwisikiza u mulilo ansi ku zwa kwigulu a bantu bonse na ba lolelele. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Kebaka lyo bijuliko, na ca wegwa uku tenda ko nguzu jo cikolo-kolo ce tanzi, kale ca omenena a bantu aba ba jakite mwilonga. Kale ca ba ta buti ba sumpe i cibumbantu ku kutika i cikolo-kolo ici se ci kubazigwa ku kafulo a kanene mi kono na ca gola uku joja kame. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />I cikolo-kolo cabili kale ca wegwa inguzu jo ku wa u muuja ku cibumbantu co cikolo-kolo ce tanzi, buti ceco i cibumbantu ci gole uku gamba no ku leta buti a bantu bonse aba na ba kana uku lapela i cibumbantu ba yagigwe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Kale ca indikiza a bantu bonse, a banene no banunu, aba ba kwesi u lubono no bampale, a baika na ba ta ba li a baika, buti ba tambule i ciganto a maganja go mulyo kampa a makumo gabo, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />buti ba leke uku gula kampa uku gulisa mbwita ati na ba kwesi ceco i ciganto, mi nde zina lyo cikolo-kolo kampa impalo je zina lyaco.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Aa mpa ku shaakala a magano. U muntu gense uju a shugwilisa a bale jejo impalo jo cikolo-kolo, kakuli ni mpalo jo muntu. Mi jejo impalo ndi 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ingu-gana no bantu ba 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Kame kale nda lola, mi kale nda bona Ingu-gana ji zimene Elundu lya Sione, mi ka ji zimene no bantu ba 144,000 aba ka ba ñoletwe izina lyakwe ne zina Lyesi a makumo gabo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Mi kale nda shugwa inzumo kwigulu sinagwe ni nzumo jo menzi a mangi ga kumpa no mulinga u munene go mvula. U mushugwaalilo na nda shugwa ngwa ku koza sinagwe mbagombi bo maalepa ba gomba a maalepa gabo.<verse eid="REV 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Mi ka ba zimba u lwimbo u luya na ba zimene a fuwi no cikalo co bumfumu, na ba zimene a fuwi no bibumbigwa i byumi byone no a fuwi no bakulu. Mi takuli uju ka gola uku lu li ziga mbwita babo a bantu ba 144,000 aba na ba lamwinwa mwilonga. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Baba mbantu aba ta na ba li lamba-lamba kwitukuta no banakazi, kakuli na ba joja u bumi bo ku sa lala no banakazi. Ba sa umpilila bulyo Ingu-gana konse uku a ja. Na ba guligwa ku ba zwisa ku bantu bonse no ku wegwa sinagwe ncitagilo co mitamuno kwa Nyambe mane no ku Ngu-gana. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ta ba la gamba byo manya mi ta ba kwesi u mulandu.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">A mañiloi go tatwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Kame kale nda bona iñiloi limwinya li gulukite mwigulu-gulu, ka li indite a majwi a malotu aga ta ga mani buti li lugwile a bantu bonse ba joja ansi, malonga gonse, maasi gonse, mushobo gonse no bantu bonse. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Kale lya kugiliza mwijwi inene ku gongoza na lyo, “Mu joge Nyambe mi mu mu we impazimo, kakuli inako jakwe jo ku atula ji la siki. Mu mu lapele uju na ga bumba igulu, ilonga, a mawate mane no tuziba-ziba to menzi.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Iñiloi lyabili kale lya umpilila lyetanzi mi kale lya ta na lyo, “ ‘Na ga gwa! Na ga gwa Bbabbilona u Munene,’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isaya 21:9</ref>. </char></note> uju ka nywisa a bantu bo malonga gonse kwa waine a vulumukisa go cise cakwe.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Iñiloi lya tatu kale lya ga umpilila na li kugiliza mwijwi inene na lyo, “Ati u muntu gense na lapela i cikolo-kolo no cibumbantu caco mane no ku tambula i ciganto caco a nkumo kampa eganja, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />nage kuti na nywe kwa waine go bukali bwa Nyambe, uju na ga sintiligwa mu nkomoki jakwe uku na kaliite. Mi kuti na bangisigwe mu mulilo no silufula a mañiloi ga cenete no Ngu-gana na ba mu wene. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Mi u busi bo ku bangisigwa kwabo kuti na bu twishaganine mwigulu bulyao ku twala koko. Ta na ku be no ku wisa a kamwi no masiku ku muntu gense uju a lapela i cikolo-kolo no cibumbantu caco, kampa ku muntu gense uju a tambula i ciganto cezina lyaco.” <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Aa mpa ku shakaala inzundamo ku lubazu lo bantu ba Nyambe aba ba cenete aba ba kutika i milao jakwe no ku sepaala kwa Jesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Mi kale nda shugwa ijwi kwigulu li ta na lyo, “U ñole buti, imfwijaguzi nja bantu aba ba fwila kwa Mfumwetu Jesu ku zwa aano ku twala koko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">U Moya mbuti gu co buti, “Ee, kuti na ba wise ku bitendantu byabo, mi i bitendantu byabo i bilotu kuti na bi ba umpilile.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku zimbuligwa kwelonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Kale nda bona ijoba lyo ku tuba, aa ka ku kele u muntu a kozete sinagwe ndi Mwana Muntu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniele 7:13</ref>. </char></note> go ciusi co bumfumu co citale ca gauda ku mutwi na kwatilile i cekesi iceku mwiganja lyakwe. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Mi iñiloi limwinya kale lya zwa mu tempele mi kale lya kugiliza mwijwi inene kwa jojo ka kele ejoba na lyo, “U inde i cekesi lyako u zimbule, kakuli inako jo ku zimbula na ja sika, mi u lukau lwa mwilonga na lwa bi zwa.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Mi jojo u muntu ka kele ejoba kale ga shonjela i cekesi lyakwe mwilonga, mi ilonga kale lya zimbuligwa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, iñiloi limwinya kale lya zwa mu tempele ja kwigulu, mi na lyo ka li kwatilile i cekesi iceku. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Iñiloi limwinya kame ili ka li kwesi inguzu a mulilo, kale lya zwa ku lutala no ku kugiliza mwijwi inene kwa jojo ka kwatilile i cekesi iceku na lyo, “Inda i cekesi lyako iceku mi u gwanike i bikocela byo biyango bya veine bya mwilonga, kakuli se bi li bizwite.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Lelyo iñiloi kale lya shonja i cekesi lyalyo mwilonga, no ku gwanika i bikocela byalyo bya veine, no ku bi shonjela mwilambo lyo cindanda co bushanshu bwa Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Mi kale bya lyataguligwa momo mwilambo lyo cindanda kunze jo munzi, mi a malowa kale ga kumpa ku zwa mwilambo lyo cindanda ku kukila mwilindi li sika a bule bo mitagulukilo ja 300,000,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbule bu shaka uku sika a makilomita ga 300.</char></note> mi a malowa kale ga ngiya buti umbizi go ku muna aa zimanamo ga sa mu sika mwivumo.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">A mañiloi ga 7 no mapenzi go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Kale nda bona mwigulu i cijuliko cimwinya ici cinene ici ci komokwisa co mañiloi ga 7 aga ka ga kwatilile a mapenzi ga 7 go mamaninino, aga na ga lete buti u bukali bwa Nyambe bu mane. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Mi kale nda bona i cintu ka ci bonaala sinagwe ndi wate lyo cimponi ili li gwanikitwe no mulilo. Mi kumbali newate ka ku zimene a bantu aba na ba gola i cikolo-kolo no cibumbantu caco mane no mpalo je zina lyaco. Ka ba kwatilile a maalepa aga na ga ba wa Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Mi kame ka ba zimba u lwimbo lwa Mushe uju ka li muika gwa Nyambe, mane no lwimbo lo Ngu-gana nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“I bitendantu byako mbinene mi bi la komokwisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">gwe Mfumu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">A mazila gako nga niti no ku lulikila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">gwe Mfumu go malonga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, “U Mfumu go manako gonse.”</char></note>.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ndini ta na ku joge, igwe gwe Mfumu Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">no ku leta impazimo kwizina lyako?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Kakuli ndigwe gwenke u cenete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">A bantu bo malonga gonse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kuti na ba keze afuwi negwe no ku ku lapela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">kakuli i bitendantu byako bi li lulikile, na bya ganunwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A majwi ga lolu u lwimbo, mu mabuka gaga na ga indigwa. Nimbo 111:2,3; Mulao 32:4; Jelemiya 10:7; Nimbo 86:9; Nimbo 98:2. </char></note><verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Aa na kwa mana byebyo, kale nda lola kwigulu mi kale nda bona i tempele mi ndi Tente jo nzumininano jo mulao, na ji galukite. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Momo mu tempele kale kwa zwa a mañiloi ga 7 aga ka ga kwatilile a mapenzi ga 7. Ka ga zwesi i bijabalo bi cenete byo ku pazima, mi ka ga li zingite inkaku ja gauda mu bizuba byago. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Mi cimwinya co bibumbigwa byone i byumi kale ca wa gago a mañiloi ga 7 u tusuba twa 7 to ku bumba a butale bwa gauda utu tu vumbite u bukali bwa Nyambe, uju a joja ku twala koko. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Mi i tempele kale ja vumba u busi ubu ka bu zwa ku mpazimo ja Nyambe no ku nguzu jakwe. Mi takuli uju ka gola uku ngina mu tempele mbwita a mañiloi ga 7 aa se ga la mani uku leta gago a mapenzi ga 7.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">U tusuba twa 7 to bunyegezi bwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Mi kale nda shugwa ijwi inene li zwa mu tempele li ta ku mañiloi ga 7 na lyo, “Mu jende, mu ka sintile mwilonga u tusuba twa 7 to bunyegezi bwa Nyambe.”<figure style="fig" alt="Bowl being poured out" file="gt00153.jpg" size="col" loc="Rev 16:1-2" ref="16:1-2">A kasuba ka vumbite u bunyegezi bwa Nyambe</figure><verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Iñiloi lyetanzi kale lya ka ja no ka sintila a kasuba kalyo elonga, mi i bilabi i bimangoju ibi bi shisha kale bya mena ku bantu aba ka ba kwesi i ciganto jo cikolo-kolo na ba ka ba lapela i cibumbantu caco.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Iñiloi lyabili kale lya sintila a kasuba kalyo ewate, mi a menzi kale ga zoka a malowa sinagwe nga muntu go ku fwa, mi i cintu conse ici ka ci joja mwiwate kale ca fwa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Iñiloi lya tatu kale lya kaja no ka sintila a kasuba kalyo a menzi gonse ga mu lwizi no mu tuziba-ziba to menzi mi kale ga zoka a malowa. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Mi kale nda shugwa iñiloi ili li babalela a menzi li ta na lyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“Uku atula kwako ku li lulikile, igwe U Cenete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">igwe u liko noju ka liko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">kakuli u la atuli bulyao,<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />kakuli na ba sinta a malowa go bantu bako aba ba cenete <optbreak />no baboni bako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">mi u la ba wi a malowa buti ba nywe kakuli mbobo <optbreak />ba botelele.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Kale nda shugwa ijwi li zwa a lutala na lyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Ee, gwe Mfumu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">uku atula kwako nkwa niti mi ku li lulikile.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Iñiloi lyane kale lya sintila a kasuba kalyo ejuba, mi ijuba kale lya zumininwa uku tenta a bantu ko mulilo. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Kale ba tentigwa ku kuya u kunene mi kale ba kuntwila izina lya Nyambe, uju ka kwesi inguzu a gago a mapenzi, kono kale ba kana uku siguluka no ku lumba Nyambe.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Iñiloi lyo bu 5 kale lya sintila a kasuba kalyo a cikalo co bumfumu co cikolo-kolo, mi u mubuso gwaco kale gwa ba mu kansindwe. A bantu kale ba shumagula indimi jabo kebaka lyo kushisha <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />mi kale ba kuntwila Nyambe gwegulu kebaka lyo kushisha kwabo no bilabi byabo, kono kale ba kana uku siguluka ku leka ibi na ba tenda.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Iñiloi lyo bu 6 kale lya sintila a kasuba kalyo a lwizi u lunene lwa Yufilati, mi a menzi galo kale ga wila ku shabwila a bamfumu ba ku buzwe-juba inzila. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Mi kale nda bona i myoya i mibi jo tatwe iji ka ji bonaala sinagwe mbimbotwe, na ji zwa mu kanwa kejoka inene no mu kanwa ko cikolo-kolo no mu kanwa ko muboni go manya. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Jejo nje myoya jo mayauma iji ji tenda i bijuliko, mi kale ja ja ku bamfumu bonse bo malonga gonse, ku ba gwanikila inkondo jejuba inene lya Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Nga mu lole, se ndi la keza sinagwe musa! Imfwijaguzi nja muntu uju a kala bu tonda no ku babalela i bizwato byakwe, buti na leke uku fwa inshoni aa jenda-jenda mu cisense mukati ko bantu.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Mi kale ja gwanika babo a bamfumu mu cibaka ci kugigwa Amagedoni mu mushobo go Ciebelu.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Iñiloi lyo bu 7 kale lya sintila a kasuba kalyo mu nkuli, mi kale kwa zwa ijwi inene mu tempele ili ka li zwa a cikalo co bumfumu, ili ka li ta na lyo, “Ku la mani!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Mi kale kwa ba no ku besagana ko mamuni go mvula, no nzumo no milinga mane no ku ukuta kweevu ku jogisa. Takuli uku ukuta kweevu kwa bulyao uku kwa la kalako ba li ku tatikila a bantu uku joja elonga. Na kwa ba uku ukuta kweevu uku ku jogesa wawa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />U munzi u munene kale gwa li taa mu mbazu jo tatwe, mi i minzi i minene jo malonga gamwinya kale ja gwa. Nyambe kale ga vuluka Bbabbilona u Munene no ku mu wa inkomoki ji vumbite waine go bunyegezi bwakwe. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />I bikuli byonse kale bya andumuka mi no malundu ta na ga gwanaala. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Kale kwa gwa imbwe inene jo ku lema ku zwa mwigulu mi kale ja gwila a bantu. Kale ba kuntwila Nyambe kebaka lya gago a mapenzi go mbwe, kakuli ka ga pengisa a bantu lwini.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">U mwanakazi no cikolo-kolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Limwinya lyo mañiloi ga 7 aga ka ga kwesi u tusuba twa 7 kale lya ndi kezela no ku ndi ta na lyo, “Keza, ndi ku sunde ubu a bangisizwa u mwanakazi go cise ci itilile, uju a kele egulu lyo menzi a mangi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />A bamfumu belonga na ba tenda i cise nage no bantu ba jakite mwilonga na ba nywisigwa ku dakwa kwa waine go cise cakwe.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Mi iñiloi kale lya ndi inda ko Moya no ku ndi twala mu mangusu. Momo kale nda ka bona u mwanakazi a kele a cikolo-kolo co ku subila ici ka ci ñoletwe a mazina go kashwau a mubili gonse. Ka ci kwesi i mitwi ja 7 no manaka ge kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />U mwanakazi ka zwesi i bizwato byo mubala go nzilu no byo ku subila, mi ka pazima ko bulungu bwa gauda ka bu besa-besa no mabwe go butokwa. Ka kwatilile inkomoki ja gauda mwiganja lyakwe, iji ka ji vumbite ibifo i bimangoju ne tukuta lyo cise cakwe. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Izina ka li ñoletwe a nkumo jakwe ka li li buzinda,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 17:5" />
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">“<char style="sc">Bbabbilona u munene</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">nyina go banakazi bo cise</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">no go bintu ibifo byelonga</char>.”<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Kale nda bona buti jojo u mwanakazi ka dakwite ku malowa go bantu ba cenete ba Nyambe, no malowa ga ba ka ba paka Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Aa ndi mu bona, kale nda komokwa lwini wawa. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Mi iñiloi kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “Ncinzi aa u komoketwe bulyao? Kuti ndi ku tolokele ubu a zindaalile jojo u mwanakazi no cikolo-kolo ici a paamite, ici ci kwesi i mitwi ja 7 no manaka ge kumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />I cikolo-kolo ici u la boni, nko ka ci li, aano ta ci si ku li, mi kuti na ci keze ku zwa mwilambo lyo kasula-muzumbi no kaja ku njoneko jaco. A bantu ba jakite mwilonga aba ta na ba ñolegwa a mazina gabo mwibuka lyo bumi ku zwa ku mbumbo jelonga kuti na ba komokwe lwini aa na ba bone i cikolo-kolo, kakuli nko ka ci li, mi ta ci si ku li aano, kono kuti na ci keze kame.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Aa mpaa ku shakaala a magano no ku shugwilisa. I mitwi ja 7 malundu ga 7 aa kele jojo u mwanakazi. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Mi kame mbamfumu ba 7. Ba 5 na ba gwa, genke ndege a si busa, mi jumwinya a sini ku sika. Aa na keze, kuti na buse a nako imfuwi bulyo. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />I cikolo-kolo ici ka ci liko, mi aano ta ci si ku li, nu mfumu go bu 8. Nage njumwinya gwa babo a bamfumu ba 7 mi ndege na je ku njoneko jakwe.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“A manaka ge kumi aga u la boni, mbamfumu be kumi aba ba sini uku tambula u mubuso tanzi. Kono kuti na ba wegwe inguzu jo bumfumu antu-onke no cikolo-kolo a nako imfuwi. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Kuti na ba kwate u mugajalo gonke bulyo mi kuti na ba we inguzu jabo no bumfumu bwabo ku cikolo-kolo. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Kuti na ba lwise Ingu-gana, kono Ingu-gana kuti na ba gole kakuli nu Mfumu go bamfumu no Mubusisi go babusisi mi a bantu na kale nabo mbantu bakwe aba na ba kugigwa, no ku shaligwa no baumpilili ba sepaala.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Mi iñiloi kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “A menzi u la boni, aa kele u mwanakazi go cise, mbantu a bangi bo malonga no bo migambilo jonse. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />I cikolo-kolo no manaka ge kumi ibi u la boni kuti na bi zimbe jojo u mwanakazi go cise. Kuti na bi mu tape i bintu a kwesi no ku mu leka sa kele i cisense. Kuti na bi lye inyama jo mubili gwakwe no ku mu tenta ko mulilo. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kakuli Nyambe na ga tula uku zumininana mu myojo jabyo jo ku tenda ubu ka gajile. Kuti na ba zumininane uku wa i cikolo-kolo inguzu jabo jo ku jendesa ku twala a majwi ga Nyambe aa na ga vumbilizwe. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />U mwanakazi u la boni, munzi u munene ugu gu busa egulu lyo bamfumu belonga.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Uku gwa ko munzi u munene gwa Bbabbilona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, kale nda bona iñiloi limwinya li zwa kwigulu keza ansi. Ka li kwesi inguzu inene, mi ilonga kale lya tubiswa ku mpazimo jalyo. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Keejwi lyo nguzu kale lya kugiliza na lyo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Na ga gwa! Na ga gwa Bbabbilona u Munene!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isaya 21:9</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Na gwa zoka u munzi go mayauma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">no ntolongo jo myoya ta ji cenete jonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">no ntolongo jo bijuni byonse ibi ta bi cenete</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">intolongo jo bipagu ibi ta bi cenete ibi bi zimbitwe.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kakuli a bantu bo malonga gonse na ba nywa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">kwa waine a vulumukisa go cise cakwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">A bamfumu bo malonga na ba tendanga i cise nage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">mi a bagulisi bo malonga na ba ba no lubono kebaka lyo minyakulo jakwe ji itilile.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Mi kale nda shugwa ijwi limwinya mwigulu li ta na lyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“ ‘Mu zwe kwakwe, mwe bantu bangu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">buti mu leke uku li taila nage ku bitendantu i bimangoju byakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">buti na mu leke uku tambula ku mapenzi gakwe.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kakuli i bitendantu i bimangoju byakwe bi li bundikitwe sinagwe ndi sita li ka sika kwigulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">mi Nyambe na ga vuluka i milandu jakwe.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mu mu tende ubu sa tendela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mu mu lomboze ko bile a bintu sa tenda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Inkomoki iji sa vumba mu ji mu vumbile ko bile nage.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mu mu bangise lwini no ku mu shugwisa uku shisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">sinagwe ubu ka likolela i minyakulo no ku litunta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Mu mojo gwakwe ka tanga buti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ndi li kele a cikalo co bumfumu sinagwe ndi li mfumu go mwanakazi, ta ndi li umfwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">mi ta ndi si tompi.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kebaka lelyo mwijuba lyonke bulyo a mapenzi gakwe kuti na ga mu gwane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">go lufu, no ku tompa no njala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kuti na tentigwe ko mulilo ku jonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kakuli u Mfumu Nyambe uju a mu atula ngwa nguzu.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />“A bamfumu bo malonga aba ka ba tendanga i cise nage, no ku li taila ku minyakulo jakwe kuti na ba mu lilile no ku mu tongaukila aa na ba bone u busi bo kuya kwakwe. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Kuti na ba zimanine u kule, kebaka lyo mapenzi gakwe na ba tutuma no ku lila nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“ ‘U li mpai! U li mpai! Bbabbilona gwe munzi u munene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">igwe gwe munzi gu gongwele!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Uku bangisigwa kwako na kwa keza mu nako jonke!’<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />“A bagulisi bo malonga kuti na ba lile no ku tongauka egulu lyakwe kakuli ta ku si li u muntu sa gula i bigulisantu byabo kame. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />I bigulisantu byo mabwe ga gauda, no butale bo cilivela, no mabwe go butokwa no masila go ku lelema no go mubala go nzilu no ku subila no buanda bo ku lelema no mufuta gonse go bishamu bi kwesi u mununko u mulotu. No bintu byonse byo ku panga a manaka go banjovu, no a bulonze no bitale bi gongwele wawa no bishamu bi guligwa ko masheleñi a mangi no mabwe go ku belela. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />I bigulisantu byo mafuta ga nunka nenja ga sinamoni, ga insense, go mila. I bigulisantu bya waine, no mafuta ga olive, u busu no buloto, iñombe nongu, no bambizi bo ku muna no bikocikala, no bantu aba ba gulisigwa sinagwe mbaika.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“A bagulisi kuti na ba mu te nabo, ‘I biyango ko zilwize bi la zwi kwako. U lubono lwako lonse no ku kebela-kebela kwako byonse na bya mana mi nela ta na bi gwanigwe kame.’ <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Babo a bagulisi aba ka ba gulisa byebyo i bintu no ku muna u lubono ko ku gulikiza momo mu munzi kuti na ba ka zimanine u kule, na ba tutuma kebaka lyo mapenzi gakwe. Kuti na ba lile no ku tongauka <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">“ ‘U bumpai! U bumpai mbwako! Gwe munzi u munene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">igwe ko zwesi mu bizwato byo masila go mubala go nzilu no go ku subila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">no masila go ku lelema aga ga pazima kebaka lyo bulungu bwa gauda ka bu besa-besa no mabwe go butokwa aga ga belela!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu nako jonke bulyo u lubono u lunene lulya lonse kale lwa jonaguligwa!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">“A bajendesi bonse bo mato a manene no bazugi no bantu bonse aba ka ba jenda mu mato a manene, na ba ka ba jojela a mapisinisi ga mu mawate, kuti na ba zimanine u kule. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Aa na ba bone u busi bwakwe na lyulyuma ku mulilo, kuti na ba komokwe no ku ta nabo, ‘Buti nko ka gu li u munzi ka gu kozete no gogu u munzi u munene?’ <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Kuti na ba li sukulwile isukwe a mitwi jabo, mi kuti na ba lile no ku tongauka nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“ ‘U bumpai! U bumpai mbwako, gwe munzi u munene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">u mu ka ba gwana u lubono a bantu bonse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">aba ka ba kwesi a mato aga ka ga jenda mu mawate!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Mu nako jonke na ga jonaguligwa!’<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />“Gwegulu, u jangale kebaka lyakwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Mu jangale, nenwe mwe bantu ba Nyambe aba ba cenete mwe batumigwa no baboni ba Nyambe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Kakuli Nyambe na ga mu atula kebaka lyo bu na <optbreak />ga mi tendela.”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Mi iñiloi ili ka li kwesi inguzu inene kale lya nanuna ibwe inene wawa no ku li shonjela mwiwate, mi kale lya ta na lyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Bbabbilona u munzi u munene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">kuti na gu shonjelwe ansi ko bushanshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">mi ta na gu gwanigwe kame.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Inimbo jo bantu ba gomba a maalepa a bazimbi no bantu ba siba insengo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">no bantu ba fuza a mantolombita, nela ta na bi shugwigwe kwako kame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Takuli u mubeleki go bigulisantu bibo no bibo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">uju na gwanaale kwako kame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Inzumo jo bintu bi twa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">ta ji si shugwaali mwako kame.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Ituba lye lambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ta li si muniki kwako kame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Ijwi lyo musesi no musesigwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ta bi si shugwigwa kame kwako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">A bagulisi bako mbabo ka ba li a bantu bo butokwa mwilonga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Ko mabibo gako a bantu bonse ba mu malonga na ba unguluka no ku joba.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Kwakwe nkoko na kwa gwanigwa a malowa go baboni ba Nyambe no bantu ba cenete ba Nyambe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">no go bantu bamwinya bonse aba na ba yagigwa mwilonga.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Inimbo kebaka lyo ku gwa <optbreak />kwa Bbabbilona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, kale nda shugwa sinagwe ndi jaba lyo bantu a bangi mwigulu ba vuvuta nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Nyambe a lumbigwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Injojeso no mpazimo no nguzu mbya Nyambe gwetu.<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Kakuli uku atula kwakwe nkwa conse mi ku li lulikile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Na ga atula u mwanakazi go cise ci itilile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">uju ka jonagula ilonga ko cise cakwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Nyambe na ga mu lomboza kebaka lyo malowa go baika bakwe.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Kale ba kumba kame nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Nyambe a lumbigwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">U munzi u munene se gu la ya mi u busi bwago se bu la tundumukila mwigulu ka ja ka jililila.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />A bakulu ba 24 no bibumbigwa i byumi byone kale bya gwila ansi no ku lapela Nyambe, uju ka kele a cikalo co bumfumu. Mi kale ba kumba nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Ameni, Nyambe a lumbigwe!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Mi kale kwa shugwaala ijwi li zwa a cikalo co bumfumu li ta na lyo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Mu lumbe Nyambe gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">mwe baika bakwe mwense,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">nenwe mwe bantu mu mu jogete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">a banene no bashwauki!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Kale nda shugwa kame sinagwe mbantu a bangi ba vuvuta, mane sinagwe nciujo co menzi ga jenda no ku koza sinagwe ni nzumo jo milinga jo mvula, ji zuma najo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 19:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Nyambe a lumbigwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Kakuli Mfumwetu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse ndege a busa.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ndokweni tu jangale twense no ku tangalala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">mi tu mu lumbe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Kakuli u mukiti go maseswa go Ngu-gana gu la siki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">mi u musesigwa sa li li bambite nenja.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Sa li wetwe i bijabalo byo ku lelema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">byo ku pazima no ku cena, buti a jabale.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">(I bijabalo byo ku lelema bya sa zimanina i bitendantu bi lulikile byo bantu ba cenete ba Nyambe.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Mi iñiloi kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “Ñola buti, Imfwijaguzi nja bantu aba na ba kugigwa ku mulalilo go mukiti go maseswa go Ngu-gana!” Iñiloi kale lya nungako ko ku ta na lyo, “Ga ga majwi ga conse ga Nyambe.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Aa se li la ti bulyao, kale nda gwila ku matende galyo ku li lapela. Kono kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “U leke ku tenda bulyao! Neme ndi li muika mugenzo no go bakwako bonse aba ba gunzilile mu bupaki bwa Jesu. U lapele Nyambe! Kakuli u bupaki bwa Jesu ngo moya go buboni.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">U muntu ka paamite a mbizi go ku tuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Kale nda bona igulu li galukite, mi kale kwa zwa umbizi go ku muna go ku tuba, aa ka ku paamite u muntu a kugigwa Kusepaala no Niti. Ka atula no ku lwa inkondo bu lulikile. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />A mensho gakwe nga ku koza u mulilo ugu gu jakila, mi a mutwi gwakwe mpo kakuli i biusi byo bumfumu i bingi. Ka ñoletwe izina a mubili gwakwe ili takuli u muntu a li zi mbwitege genke bulyo. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ka jabele u mukanjo na gwa cumpwikigwa mu malowa, mi izina lyakwe Ndijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />A masole ba kwigulu ka ba mu umpilile, na ba paamite a bambizi bo ku muna bo ku tuba na ba jabele i bijabalo byo ku lelema, byo ku tuba no kucena. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mu kanwa kakwe ka ku zwa a kafulo a kaceku a kanene ko ku wejesa a bantu bo malonga. “Kuti na ba jendese no ku ba busa ko mulamu go citale.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Nimbo 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Kuti na lyatagule i biyango bya veine mwilambo lyo cindanda ca waine co bushanshu bo bunyegezi bwa Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />A mukanjo gwakwe no a cibelo cakwe ka ku ñoletwe izina leli,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">“<char style="sc">Mubusisi go babusisi no Mfumu go bamfumu</char>.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Kame kale nda bona iñiloi li zimene mu kamwi. Kale lya kumba ku gongoza ku kugiliza ku bijuni byonse ibi bi gulauka-gulauka mwigulu, “Mu keze, mu li gwana-gwane antu-onke ku mulalilo u munene gwa Nyambe, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />buti mu lye inyama jo bamfumu, no bajendesi a bakulu, no masole bo nguzu, no jo bambizi bo ku muna no bantu ba paamiteo, no nyama jo bantu bonse, jo bantu ba lukuluwite no baika, a banene no bashwauki.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Mi kale nda bona i cikolo-kolo no bamfumu belonga no kagugi ko masole ba li gwana-gwana buti ba lwise u muntu uju a paamite umbizi go ku muna no kagugi ko masole bakwe. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Kono i cikolo-kolo kale ca kwatigwa, antu-onke no muboni go manya uju ka tenda i bijuliko mu kaito ko cikolo-kolo. Ko bijuliko byebyo, sa oma aba se ba tambula i ciganto co cikolo-kolo no ku lapela i cibumbantu caco. Babo bo bile kale ba shonjelwa na ba joja mwiziba lyo mulilo gwa silufula gu jakila. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Bamwinya bonse kale ba ba yaga ko kafulo a kanene aka ka ka zwa mu kanwa ko muntu uju ka paamite a mbizi go ku muna, mi i bijuni byonse kale bya nyuntagula inyama jabo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">I myaka ja 1,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Kame kale nda bona iñiloi li zwa kwigulu, na li indite i cigaluzo ce lambo lyo kasula-muzumbi na li kwatilile mwiganja lyalyo iwenge inene. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Kale lya kwata ijoka inene ili ka lili lya ku nkulu-katanzi, ili li kugigwa u mubi kampa Satani, no ku mu shumina ko myaka ja 1,000. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Kale lya mu shonjela mwilambo lyo kasula-muzumbi no ku fwinkako, ku mu kangwisa uku oma a bantu bo malonga kame ku twala jejo i myaka ja 1,000 aa na ji manine. Ku zwao, kuti na shumununwe a nako imfuwi bulyo.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Kale nda bona i bikalo byo bumfumu u mu ka ku kele a bantu aba na ba wegwa inguzu jo ku atula. Mi kale nda bona i myoya jo bantu aba na ba yagigwa ko ku kosholigwa i mitwi kebaka lyo bupaki ka ba pakila Jesu no kebaka lyeejwi lya Nyambe. Ta na ba lapela i cikolo-kolo kampa i cibumbantu caco mi ta na ba tambula i ciganto caco a makumo gabo kampa a maboko gabo. Kale ba bukila ku bumi mi kale ba busa no Kilesite a myaka ja 1,000.<verse eid="REV 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Jeji ne mbuko jetanzi (mi a bafu bamwinya bonse ta na ba buka ku twala aa na ji ka manine i myaka ja 1,000). <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ba li kwesi imfwijaguzi mi mba kucena a bantu aba na ba ligwane na ba buka mu mbuko jetanzi. U lufu lwa bili ta lu si kwesi inguzu egulu lyabo, kono kuti na ba be a mapulisiti ba Nyambe no ba Kilesite mi kuti na ba buse nage mu myaka ja 1,000.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satani aa atuligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />I myaka ja 1,000 aa se ji la mani, Satani kuti na zwisigwe mu ntolongo jakwe <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />mi kuti na je mu mbazu jone jelonga buti aka ome a bantu bo malonga gonse ga Gogo no Magogo, ku ba gwanikila inkondo. Mbantu ba sika a mpalo ji jelekelela ne bwetete lye ekamba lyewate. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Kale ba jenda bu kakite ilonga mu bumfuge bwalyo no ka zimbuluka a mafulo go bantu ba Nyambe no munzi ugu a shaka. Kono u mulilo kale gwa zwa kwigulu keza ku ba jona. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />No Satani uju ka ba oma, kale ga shonjelwa mwiziba lyo mulilo gu jakila gwa silufula, u mu se ka ku shonjelwe i cikolo-kolo no muboni go manya. Mi kuti na ba bangisigwe a kamwi no masiku ku twala koko.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inkatulo jo bafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Mi kale nda bona i cikalo co bumfumu icinene co ku tuba no muntu uju ka keleo. Ilonga negulu kale bya tiga ku andumuka ku joga jojo u muntu, mi ta bya la bonigwa kame. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Mi kale nda bona a bafu a banene no banunu, ba zimene a fuwi no cikalo co bumfumu, mi a mabuka kale ga vwikuligwa. Kale kwa vwikuligwa ne buka limwinya lyo bumi. A bafu kale ba atuligwa ku ja ke bi na ba tenda ubu ka ku ñolelwe mu mabuka. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Iwate kale lya leta a bafu aba ka ba li mwalyo, mi u lufu no cibaka co bafu kale bya leta a bafu aba ka ba li mwabyo, u muntu no muntu kale ga atuligwa ku ja kwe bi na ga tenda. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Mi u lufu no cibaka co bafu kale bya shonjelwa mwiziba lyo mulilo. Iziba lyo mulilo ndo lufu lwa bili. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Ati izina lyo muntu gense ta ka li gwanaala li ñoletwe mwibuka lyo bumi, ige ka shonjelwa mwiziba lyo mulilo.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Igulu iya nelonga iya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Mi kale nda bona igulu iya nelonga iya, kakuli igulu lyetanzi nelonga lyetanzi na bya zwako, mi ta kusili iwate kame. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Kale nda bona u Munzi gu Cenete, Jelusalema u muya, na gu keza ansi ku zwa kwigulu kwa Nyambe, na gu li bambite nenja sinagwe musesigwa a jabele nenja ku cengamina muntu gwakwe. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Kale nda shugwa ijwi inene li zwa mu cikalo co bumfumu li ta na lyo, “Nga mu lole! I cibaka u mu a kala Nyambe se cilili no bantu, mi kuti na kale nabo. Kuti na ba be a bantu bakwe, mi Nyambe ige wawa kuti na kale nabo no ku ba Nyambe gwabo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />‘Kuti na singule i minsozi jonse ku mensho gabo. Ta na ku kale u lufu nela’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isaya 25:8</ref>. </char></note> kampa uku tompa kampa uku lila kampa uku shisha, kakuli u mukalilo go bintu byo kale na gwa zwako.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />U muntu uju ka kele a cikalo co bumfumu kale ga ta nage, “Nga mu lole, se ndi la tenda i bintu byonse u buya!” Mi kale ga ndi ta kame nage, “U ga ñole gago a majwi kakuli majwi ga sepaala mi nga conse.”<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Kame kale ga ta nage, “Ku la tendaali! Ndime Alufa no Omega, go Matatikilo no go Mamaninino. U muntu uju a fwite inyotwa kuti na ndi mu nywise ku menzi ga jenda go bumi aga ta ga guligwa. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />A bantu aba na ba li gongoze no ku gola kuti na ba jobole byonse byebi, mi kuti na ndi be Nyambe gwabo abo na ba be banangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Kono bo lyoga, na ba ta ba zumini, no bantu a babi, no bayagi, no bo cise, no bantu aba ba tenda a mabibo, na ba ba lapela a bazimu no bo manya bonse, abo kuti na ba be mwiziba lyo mulilo gu jakila gwa silufula. Lolu ndo lufu lwa bili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Iñiloi limwinya lyo mañiloi ga 7 aga ka ga kwesi u tusuba twa 7 to mapenzi ga 7 go mamaninino kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “Keza, mi kuti ndi ku sundise u musesigwa, muka Ngu-gana.”<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Mi kale ga ndi inda ko Moya ku ndi twala elundu inene ile, no ka ndi sundisa u Munzi gu Cenete, Jelusalema, na gu sezumukila ansi ku zwa kwigulu kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Ka gu pazima kebaka lyetuba lya Nyambe, mi uku pazima kwago ka ku bonaala sinagwe ndibwe lyo butokwa kampa ibwe lya jasipa, no ku belela sinagwe ndibwe lya kilisitale. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />U munzi ka gu kwesi u lubaga u lunene, u lule lo mabwe ulu ka lu kwesi i bizi bye kumi no byo bile, ibi ka bi mameligwa ku mañiloi ge kumi no go bile. A cizi no cizi ka ku ñoletwe a mazina go maasi ge kumi no go bile go bantu ba Isilaele. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Ku lubazu lwa ku buzwe-juba mbizi byo tatwe, no ku lubazu lwa ku mutulo mbizi byo tatwe. Ku lubazu lwa ku mbogela mbizi byo tatwe, no ku lubazu lwa ku bugwe-juba mbizi byo tatwe. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />U lubaga lo munzi ka lu kwesi insumpo je kumi no jo bile. Mpaa ka ku ñoletwe a mazina ge kumi no go bile go batumigwa bo Ngu-gana.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Iñiloi ili ka li gambagula neme ka li kwatilile a kajelekeziso ka gauda ko ku jelekezisa u munzi, no bizi byago no mbaga jago, ka kozete sinagwe ndutaka. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />U munzi ka gu kwesi imbazu jone, mi mu bule bwago ka gu jelekelele no mu bufuwi bwago. Iñiloi kale lya jelekeza u munzi ka lolo u lutaka mi kale lya gwana buti mu bule, no mu bumfuge mane no mu bule bo ku ja mwigulu u lubaga mitagulukilo ja 2,200,000.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbule bu shaka uku sika a makilomita ga 2,200. </char></note> <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Kale lya jelekeza no bunene bo lubaga, mi kale kwa gwanaala buti milyatilo jo matende ga li nungite ja 200.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />U lubaga ka lu jakiswe ko mabwe ga jasipa, mi u munzi ka gu jakiswe ko mabwe ga gauda go kucena, mi ka ga begela sinagwe ncimponi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />A mabwe go nsumpo jo lubaga lo munzi ka ga basitwe ko mabwe ga andene-andene go butokwa. Ibwe lyetanzi ka lili lya jasipa, lyabili ka lili lya safila, lya tatu ka lili lya kalusedoni, lyane ka lili lya emelaluda, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ibwe lyo bu 5 ka lili lya sadonikisi, mi lyo bu 6 ka lili lya lubi, lyo bu 7 ka lili lya kilisolite, lyo bu 8 ka lili lya bbelili, ibwe lyo bu 9 ka lili lya topazi, lye kumi ndya tekoise, ibwe lyo bu 11 ka lili lya jakinto, ibwe lyo bu 12 ka lili lya ametisito.<verse eid="REV 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />I bizi bye kumi no byo bile byo ka bi li byo ku tenda a mabwe ge kumi no go bile go butokwa aga ga kugigwa a mapelela, i cigalo no cigalo nca ku bumba epelela lyonke. Inzila inene jo munzi u munene ka ji jalitwe ko mabwe ga gauda go kucena, aga ga belela sinagwe ncimponi.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Ta na nda bona i tempele momo mu munzi, kakuli u Mfumu Nyambe go Nguzu-Jonse no Ngu-gana nde tempele jo munzi. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />U munzi ta gu zundi ituba lyejuba kampa lyo kwezi, kakuli ituba lya Nyambe ndelyo li gu munikila, mi Ingu-gana nde lambi lyago. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />A bantu bo malonga kuti na ba jende mwituba lyago, mi a bamfumu bo malonga kuti na ba letemo u lubono lwabo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Takuli ijuba nanga ndyonke ili na ku galigwe ku bizi byo munzi, kakuli ta na ku be a masiku momo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Impazimo nekute lyo bantu bo malonga kuti na bi letigwe momo mu munzi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Takuli i cintu ta ci cenete ici na ci nginemo, kampa u muntu uju a tenda byo nshoni kampa go manya. Kuti na ku nginemo bulyo a bantu aba ba ñoletwe a mazina mwibuka lyo bumi lyo Ngu-gana.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">U lwizi lo bumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Mi iñiloi kale lya ndi sundisa u lwizi lo menzi go bumi, ulu ka lu pazima sinagwe ndibwe lya kilisitale, na lu jendesa a menzi galo ku zwa a cikalo co bumfumu ca Nyambe no co Ngu-gana. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Ka ga jenda ku itila mukati ko nzila inene iji ka ji ita a kati ko munzi u munene. A makamba galo mwisilya-no-mwisilya mo ka ku menete i cishamu co bumi ici ka ci aka i biyango ko miakilo je kumi no jo bile, na ci binzwisa i biyango byaco mu kwezi mu kwezi. Mi a mani ga co nga ku oza a bantu bo malonga.<verse eid="REV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ta ku si li i cikuto kame. I cikalo co bumfumu ca Nyambe no co Ngu-gana kuti na bi be momo mu munzi u munene, mi a baika bakwe kuti na ba mu sebeleze. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Kuti na ba bone inkumo jakwe, mi izina lyakwe kuti na li ñoligwe a makumo gabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Ta na ku be no masiku kame. Ta na ba zunde ne tuba lyo lumuni lwa lambi kampa ituba lyejuba, kakuli u Mfumu Nyambe kuti na ba we ituba. Mi kuti na ba buse ku twala koko.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani ne ñiloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Iñiloi kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “Ga ga a majwi ga la sepaala mi nga niti. U Mfumu, Nyambe uju a ujilila mu myoya jo baboni bakwe, na ga tuma iñiloi lyakwe keza ku sunda a baika bakwe i bintu ibi bi botele uku tendaala wangu.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Ngolole, se nde keza aano! Imfwijaguzi nja muntu uju a kutika a majwi go buboni aga ga ñoletwe momu mwibuka.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ime nde Joani, ndime wawa na nda shugwa no ku bona byebi i bintu. Mi aa se ndi la bi shugwi no ku bi bona, kale nda gwila ansi afuwi no matende geñiloi ili ka li bi ndi sunda no ku li lapela. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Kono kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “U leke ku tenda bulyao! Neme ndi li muika sinagwe ndigwe mane no go bakwako a baboni ba Nyambe no bantu bonse aba ba kutika a majwi ga li momu mwibuka. U lapele Nyambe!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Mi kale lya ndi ta na lyo, “U leke ku lamika gaga a majwi go buboni aga ga li momu mwibuka kakuli inako se ji li li afuwi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />U leke u muntu a tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju a twalilile mu ku tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju bulyao, mi u muntu u mubi a twalilile mu bubi bwakwe bulyao. U muntu a tenda i bitendantu bi lulikile a twalilile mu ku tenda i bitendantu bi lulikile bulyao, mi u muntu a cenete a twalilile uku ba u muntu a cenete bulyao.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Ngolole, se nde keza aano! No mupuzo gwangu ndi keza, mi kuti na ndi we ku muntu gense ku ja kwe ci na ga tenda. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ndime Alufa no Omega, Gwe tanzi no Mamaninino, Matatikilo no Ncinko.<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />“Imfwijaguzi nja bantu aba ba sanza i mikanjo jabo, buti na ba botelelwe ku cishamu co bumi mi na ba gole uku itila mu bizi no ku ngina mu munzi u munene. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Kunze kuti na ku sigale a bambwa, no bantu aba ba tenda a mabibo, no bo cise, no bayagi, na ba ba lapela i bibumbantu byo bazimu no bantu bonse aba ba shaka no ku tenda i bintu byo manya.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Ime nde Jesu, ndime na nda tuma iñiloi lyangu keza ku zibisa bo bu u bupaki ku tugugi to bazumini mu bibaka byo malapelelo. Ndi li Muisi gwa Deviti no go Mukoga gwakwe. Ndime Lungwe u Lutungwezi lu munika lwini lo maca-siku.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />U Moya go Kucena no musesi kale ba ta nabo, “Keza!” Mi u muntu uju a shugwile nage a te buti, “Keza!” Mi u muntu gense uju a fwite inyotwa, a keze, mi uju a shaka gense, a keze a li indile ku menzi go bumi aga ga wegwa bulyo.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Nda sa nanguza u muntu gense uju a shugwa gaga a majwi ga bobu u buboni bu ñoletwe momu mwibuka buti, ati u muntu gense na nunga cimwinya ko ku ku majwi, Nyambe kuti na nunge kwa jojo u muntu a mapenzi gonse aga ga ñoletwe momu mwibuka. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Mi ati u muntu gense na zwisa cimwinya ku majwi ga momu mwibuka lyo buboni, Nyambe kuti na zwise kwakwe u mutailo gwakwe ugu ka botelelwe uku tailwa ku cishamu co bumi mane no mu Munzi gu Cenete, ibi bi tolokitwe momu mwibuka.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />U muntu uju a paka byebi i bintu mbuti a co buti, “Ee, sende keza aano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni. Keza, Mfumwetu Jesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />I cisemo ca Mfumwetu Jesu ci be no bantu ba Nyambe bonse. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>